ationsstärke, Teamfähigkeit und Durchsetzungsvermögen</p></li><li><p>Gute Deutschkenntnisse, sehr gute Polnischkenntnisse</p></li></ul><h2>Benefits</h2><ul><li><p>Abwechslungsreiches Aufgabengebiet mit internationalem Bezug</p></li><li><p>Motiviertes, kollegiales Team mit flachen Hierarchien</p></li><li><p>Homeoffice</p></li><li><p>Mitarbeiterevents & kleine Aufmerksamkeiten im Alltag</p></li><li><p>Fort- und Weiterbildungsmöglichkeiten</p></li><li><p>Bezuschusste betriebliche Altervorsorge</p></li><li><p>Bonuskarte mit 50€ Einkaufswert pro Monat</p></li><li><p>27 Tage Urlaub, jährlich steigend bis 32 Tage</p></li><li><p>Kostenlose Getränke & Obst</p></li><li><p>Kostenloser Parkplatz</p></li></ul><p>Haben wir Ihr Interesse geweckt? Dann freuen wir uns auf eine aussagekräftige Bewerbung von Ihnen.</p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/uai-solutions/kundendienstmitarbeiter-forderungsmanagement-polnisch-eggenfelden-244627","tags":["Accounts Receivable"],"job_types":["Unbefristeter arbeitsvertrag","berufseinstieg"],"location":"Eggenfelden","created_at":1794609034},{"slug":"kundendienstmitarbeiter-forderungsmanagement-polnisch-berlin-426867","company_name":"UAI SOLUTIONS","title":"Kundendienstmitarbeiter Forderungsmanagement Polnisch (m/w/d)","description":"<p><strong>Gemeinsam halten wir Prozesse in Bewegung.</strong></p><p>Die UAI SOLUTIONS Firmengruppe entwickelt und betreibt innovative Lösungen für Mobilität, Verwaltungsprozesse und internationale Dienstleistungen in Europa. Unser Ziel ist es, Mobilität einfacher, transparenter und effizienter zu gestalten.</p><p>Dabei stehen Menschen, Verantwortung, Zusammenarbeit und nachhaltige Lösungen im Mittelpunkt unseres Handelns. Unsere Vision lautet „Smart solutions for seamless mobility“. Mit innovativen End-to-End-Lösungen unterstützen wir unsere Kunden dabei, Prozesse einfach, nachvollziehbar und zuverlässig umzusetzen. Dazu gehört auch, offene mobilitätsbezogene Vorgänge mit den Fahrzeughaltern unserer Kunden transparent und möglichst reibungslos zu klären.</p><p>Zur Verstärkung unseres Teams suchen wir ab sofort eine engagierte Persönlichkeit für den Bereich <strong>Forderungsmanagment</strong>.</p><h2>Aufgaben</h2><ul><li><p>Bearbeitung und Überwachung offener Forderungen im In- und Ausland</p></li><li><p>Schriftliche und telefonische Kommunikation mit Schuldnern</p></li><li><p>Fachkompetente Beratung der Schuldner</p></li><li><p>Sicherstellung der Qualitätsanforderungen des Auftraggebers und der Kundenzufriedenheit</p></li><li><p>Erfassung der Geschäftsvorfälle in der Unternehmenssoftware</p></li><li><p>Unterstützung bei der Weiterentwicklung unserer internen Prozesse im Forderungsmanagement</p></li></ul><h2>Qualifikation</h2><ul><li><p>Abgeschlossene kaufmännische Ausbildung oder vergleichbare Qualifikation</p></li><li><p>Erste Berufserfahrung im Bereich Inkasso / Forderungsmanagement von Vorteil</p></li><li><p>Gute MS-Office-Kenntnisse, insbesondere Excel</p></li><li><p>Sorgfältige, strukturierte und eigenverantwortliche Arbeitsweise</p></li><li><p>Kommunikationsstärke, Teamfähigkeit und Durchsetzungsvermögen</p></li><li><p>Gute Deutschkenntnisse, sehr gute Polnischkenntnisse</p></li></ul><h2>Benefits</h2><ul><li><p>Remote Work: Nach einer 3-wöchigen Einarbeitung in Eggenfelden arbeiten Sie remote, mit einer Präsenzwoche pro Quartal am Standort</p></li><li><p>Abwechslungsreiches Aufgabengebiet mit internationalem Bezug</p></li><li><p>Motiviertes, kollegiales Team mit flachen Hierarchien</p></li><li><p>Mitarbeiterevents & kleine Aufmerksamkeiten im Alltag</p></li><li><p>Fort- und Weiterbildungsmöglichkeiten</p></li><li><p>Bezuschusste betriebliche Altervorsorge</p></li><li><p>Bonuskarte mit 50€ Einkaufswert pro Monat</p></li><li><p>27 Tage Urlaub, jährlich steigend bis 32 Tage</p></li><li><p>Kostenlose Getränke & Obst</p></li><li><p>Kostenloser Parkplatz</p></li></ul><p>Haben wir Ihr Interesse geweckt? Dann freuen wir uns auf eine aussagekräftige Bewerbung von Ihnen.</p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":true,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/uai-solutions/kundendienstmitarbeiter-forderungsmanagement-polnisch-berlin-426867","tags":["Remote","Accounts Receivable"],"job_types":["Unbefristeter arbeitsvertrag","berufseinstieg"],"location":"Berlin","created_at":1794609034},{"slug":"customer-success-manager-berlin-374290","company_name":"Vetpal GmbH","title":"Customer Success Manager","description":"<p>We're building the AI operating system for vets. Our AI agent Emma already runs client communication for clinics in 7 countries, including the largest veterinary groups in the world. As Customer Success Manager, you make sure every clinic gets the most out of Emma, from the first setup to the day they can't imagine working without her.</p><h2>About Vetpal</h2><p>There are more pets than ever, and fewer vets to care for them. Clinics are short on staff, vets spend half their day on admin, and their suicide rate is six times higher than average. We're building the AI operating system for vets. From the first phone call to the invoice, we give vets their time back, with the mission to bring pets, pet owners and their vets closer together.</p><h2>The role</h2><p>You own the relationship with our clinics once they've signed. You onboard new practices, set up Emma so she fits the way each clinic works, and become the person practice teams call when they have a question or an idea. You're the bridge between vets and our product: you explain a technical product in the language of everyday practice life, and you bring what you hear back to our engineers. You work closely with the founders and the rest of our CS team.</p><h2>What you'll work on</h2><ul><li><p>Onboard new clinics and configure Emma to match their workflows, phone setup and practice software</p></li><li><p>Be the go-to contact for your clinics, from small practices to large clinic groups</p></li><li><p>Run trainings and regular check-ins so practice teams use Emma every day</p></li><li><p>Keep an eye on account health, spot risks early and find opportunities to grow accounts</p></li><li><p>Solve customer questions fast and hand technical issues to engineering with the right details</p></li><li><p>Turn customer feedback into clear input for our product team</p></li><li><p>Help build our CS playbook, help center and processes as we scale across Europe</p></li></ul><h2>Who thrives here</h2><ul><li><p>You genuinely enjoy talking to customers, on the phone, on site and in writing</p></li><li><p>You're technically curious, understand how software, integrations and phone systems fit together, and can explain them simply to a busy practice team</p></li><li><p>You bring experience in customer success or account management, ideally in B2B SaaS</p></li><li><p>Big plus: you're a trained veterinary nurse (TFA) or have worked in a vet practice yourself, so you know practice life from the inside</p></li><li><p>You're structured and reliable, and you keep your accounts and CRM clean</p></li><li><p>You speak fluent German and English, more languages are a plus</p></li></ul><h2>What we offer</h2><ul><li><p>Competitive salary and equity</p></li><li><p>A role you can shape from day one as we build out customer success</p></li><li><p>Direct access to the founders and full visibility into every decision</p></li><li><p>A small, talent-dense team in Berlin that works with speed and intensity</p></li></ul><h2><strong>Interview process</strong></h2><ul><li><p>Intro Call</p></li><li><p>Deep Dive</p></li><li><p>Take-Home Case</p></li><li><p>Meet the Team</p></li><li><p>References</p></li><li><p>Offer</p></li></ul><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/vetpal-gmbh/customer-success-manager-berlin-374290","tags":["Customer Service"],"job_types":["Permanent employment (unbefristeter arbeitsvertrag)","professional / experienced"],"location":"Berlin","created_at":1794607236},{"slug":"people-operations-working-student-308837","company_name":"gympass","title":"People Operations Working Student (m/f/d)","description":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your wellbeing, our mission. Join a company shaping a healthier world.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;GET TO KNOW US&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Wellhub we&#39;re revolutionizing workplace wellness. Our platform connects employees worldwide to the best partners for fitness, mindfulness, therapy, nutrition, and sleep—all in one simple subscription. Headquartered in NYC with team members in Europe, North America and South America, we’re on a mission to make every company a wellness company. We believe work should be fulfilling, inspiring, and balanced. Here, you’ll find a team that values wellbeing, collaboration, and different perspectives, where passion and creativity push boundaries to create real impact. Your contributions will help shape a healthier, more balanced world for you and millions of people globally. Join us in redefining the future of wellbeing!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us in redefining the future of wellbeing!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE OPPORTUNITY&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are hiring a &lt;strong&gt;People Operations Working Student &lt;/strong&gt;for a 6-month contract to our &lt;strong&gt;People Operations&lt;/strong&gt; team in &lt;strong&gt;Berlin, Germany&lt;/strong&gt;!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is to join our People Operations team, dedicated to delivering an exceptional employee experience across Europe. In this role, you will contribute to meaningful People initiatives and gain valuable exposure to key HR topics(e.g. employment law and payroll). You will also gain&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;valuable exposure to&lt;strong&gt; driving efficient operations at scal&lt;/strong&gt;e. You will have the opportunity to learn and apply&lt;strong&gt; analytical problem-solving, a process-oriented mindset, stakeholder management and AI automation &lt;/strong&gt;to elevate our HR systems (e.g., Personio) and workflows… all within a dynamic, international environment. Whilst you will be based in Germany, you will be working on operations across European markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR IMPACT&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employee Care:&lt;/strong&gt; Respond thoughtfully to employee queries, ensuring quick, effective resolutions and an exceptional day-to-day experience for our team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process Mindset &amp;amp; Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Ensure high accuracy and operational efficiency in core HR processes (e.g. maintaining Personio data, payroll) by following clear procedures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solution-Oriented Problem Solving:&lt;/strong&gt; Challenge the status quo by focusing on solutions rather than getting bogged down in problems. Use data and a process mindset to proactively identify ways to optimize workflows and leverage automation to better serve our employees at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Live the mission: &lt;/strong&gt;inspire and empower others by genuinely caring for your own wellbeing and your colleagues. Bring wellbeing to the forefront of work, and create a supportive environment where everyone feels comfortable taking care of themselves, taking time off, and finding work-life wellness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHO YOU ARE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are currently enrolled in a university, your specific degree subject matter does not matter but an interest in HR, Finance and operations is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are available at least 15h/week (max. 20 hours)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A fluent communicator with C1+ level proficiency in both written and spoken German and English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A Berlin-based candidate who can work on-site from our Head Office 2–3 times per week.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A discreet professional with a proven ability to handle confidential and sensitive information with high integrity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A self-driven, adaptable, and collaborative team player with excellent organizational skills and strong attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive learner passionate about employee experience, eager to develop skills in data-driven problem solving, project management, stakeholder management, and operations across Europe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We recognize that individuals approach job applications differently. We strongly encourage all aspiring applicants to go for it, even if they don&#39;t match the job description 100%. We welcome your application and will be delighted to explore if you could be a great fit for our team. For this specific role, please note that &lt;strong&gt;current university enrollment and fluency in German and English (C1+) are mandatory requirements.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT WE OFFER YOU&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With thoughtful benefits, emotional wellbeing resources, and a culture that empowers you to take ownership of your role and your wellbeing, we create an environment where you can thrive in all dimensions of your life. Our benefits include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WELLHUB:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; Free Gold membership with access to onsite gyms and studios, digital fitness programs, and online wellness resources for meditation, nutrition, mental wellbeing support, and more! Add up to three family members to your plan, ensuring access to wellness for those who matter most to you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FLEXIBLE WORK:&lt;/strong&gt; As a Flexible First company, we offer hybrid and remote options to give you the freedom to work in a way that suits you. The model for this specific role can be discussed with your recruiter and hiring manager. We offer all employees a one-time reimbursement to set up their home office equipment and a monthly work allowance to help cover the costs of working from home.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FLEXIBLE SCHEDULE: &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Flexibility for us isn’t just about where we work—it also means being able to shape how and when we get things done. Together with their leaders, employees define schedules that align with their time zones, team needs, and personal routines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PAID TIME OFF:&lt;/strong&gt; We know how important it is to take time away from work to recharge.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PARENTAL LEAVE:&lt;/strong&gt; Welcoming a new child is one of the most special moments in your life. Take the time to be present and enjoy your growing family. We offer 100% paid parental leave to all new parents. Parents giving birth are eligible for an extended leave and a ramp-back period to return part-time while they get settled.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CAREER GROWTH:&lt;/strong&gt; Access world-class platforms, participate in interactive sessions,&amp;nbsp; build your personalized development roadmap, and explore internal opportunities. We focus on continuous learning and feedback to support your journey toward personal and professional success.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CULTURE:&lt;/strong&gt; You’ll join a team of passionate people who come together to break boundaries, support each other, and create a meaningful impact in workplace wellness. We win together, building trust through open communication and a culture where every perspective matters. &lt;a href=&quot;https://wellhub.com/en-us/careers/our-values/&quot;&gt;Learn more about our shared culture and values here.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Want to see what it’s really like to work here? Follow us on &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/lifeatwellhub/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Instagram&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt; @lifeatwellhub and watch our team video on &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZgIPiszTVm4&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YouTube&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity, and Belonging at Wellhub&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We aim to create a collaborative, supportive, and inclusive space where everyone knows they belong. At Wellhub, we welcome and celebrate your authentic self.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wellhub is committed to creating a diverse work environment and is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, religion, color, sex, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, age, non-disqualifying physical or mental disability, national origin, veteran status, or any other basis covered by appropriate law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our commitment to inclusion also extends to how we recognize and reward our people. We’re proud to be Syndio Fair Pay Certified, reflecting our ongoing dedication to equitable and fair pay practices across our global team. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/posts/wellhub_fairpay-syndio-activity-7407826561531363328-wbN_?utm_source=share&amp;amp;utm_medium=member_desktop&amp;amp;rcm=ACoAAAzHQWABKsRqcpvxy4QpDCJNe_szRdC4hgY&quot;&gt;Read more about it here.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Questions on how we treat your personal data? See our &lt;a href=&quot;https://wellhub.com/en-us/careers/job-applicant-privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;Job Applicant Privacy Notice.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(224, 62, 45);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/gympass/people-operations-working-student-308837","tags":["People"],"job_types":[],"location":"","created_at":1794606944},{"slug":"senior-commercial-program-manager-3154","company_name":"autoscout24","title":"Senior Commercial Program Manager (m/f/d)","description":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As a Commercial Strategy &amp;amp; Program Manager in our Sales Strategy &amp;amp; Operations team, you’ll manage the commercial go-to-market for on-top products across our international markets. With a particular focus on new product launches, you’ll build the business case, define the commercial approach and lead cross-functional execution from launch preparation through adoption and scaling.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You’ll be the central commercial point of contact for your assigned products, working closely with Product, Product Marketing, local sales leadership, Pricing, Finance and Analytics. You’ll turn analysis into decisions and strategy, align teams around measurable objectives and drive action when performance falls short.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This role is ideal for someone with a consulting or commercial strategy background who wants to combine analytical depth with hands-on responsibility for product commercialization.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What you’ll do:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Own go-to-market plans:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Define target customers, sales motions, market sequencing and launch priorities for on-top products. Drive execution against clear milestones and responsibilities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Build and challenge business cases:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Quantify revenue potential, expected uptake and commercial costs. Test assumptions and make clear recommendations on launch and scaling opportunities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Shape the commercial proposition:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Work with Product Marketing, Pricing and local markets to translate dealer value into a compelling commercial offer, customer targeting and sales approach.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Drive cross-functional launch readiness:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Evaluate commercial preparation, recommend market rollout sequencing and present risks, trade-offs and recommendations to leadership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Manage commercial performance:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Agree KPIs, targets and reporting requirements before launch. Analyze adoption, usage, sales conversion and revenue contribution to identify what drives or limits growth.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Turn performance insights into improvements:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Lead structured performance reviews and coordinate action plans with clear owners and timelines, escalating unresolved dependencies where needed.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Strengthen commercialization practices:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Develop reusable business case and performance-management frameworks, capture lessons learned and ensure a clear handover to ongoing owners.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What you’ll bring:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
