arty, after-work gatherings) and retreats</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">- Modern setup and laptops (Apple or Windows)</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">- Employee discounts on PERGOLUX products</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">- Jobrad / Bike leasing program, promoting sustainable and healthy commuting</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">📍 <strong>Office Location</strong> – Schlesische Str. 27 C, Building C, 6th floor, 10997 Berlin</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>How to Apply</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Ready to shape the words behind our campaigns? Apply through our [Career Page](<a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://pergolux.careers/">https://pergolux.careers/</a>) or connect with us on [LinkedIn](<a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/pergolux/posts/?feedView=all">https://www.linkedin.com/company/pergolux/posts/?feedView=all</a>).</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">PERGOLUX is an equal opportunity employer. We welcome applicants from all backgrounds, we think it's less about ticking every box and more about what you bring to the table!</p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/pergolux/copywriter-berlin-54363","tags":["Marketing"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Berlin | Global Team","created_at":1794595227},{"slug":"support-systems-programs-lead-europe-remote-berlin-462388","company_name":"N8N","title":"Support Systems & Programs Lead | Europe Remote","description":"<p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>The AI orchestration of your wildest imagination.</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">n8n is the open workflow orchestration platform built for the new era of AI. We give technical teams the freedom of code with the speed of no-code, so they can automate faster, smarter, and without limits. Backed by a fiercely inventive community and 500+ builder-approved integrations, we’re changing the way people bring systems together and scale ideas for impact.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Since our founding in 2019, we’ve grown into a diverse team of over 260 - working across Europe and the US, connected by a shared builder spirit and with our centre of gravity in Berlin. Along the way, we’ve:</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Cultivated a community of more than 650,000 active developers and builders</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Earned 190K+ GitHub stars, making us one of the world’s Top 40 most popular projects</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Backed by top investors, from Sequoia’s first German seed to our SAP's recent strategic investment - bringing us to a $5.2bn valuation</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><br />That’s the company we’ve built. Now we’d love to see what <em>you </em>can build. If you’re applying, try n8n out - whether you’re technical or not - and share a screenshot of your first workflow with us. The easiest place to start is here: <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="http://app.n8n.cloud/register"><u>app.n8n.cloud/register</u></a>.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We’re in a defining moment of an incredible journey. Come and build with us.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Your main goal will be to <strong>build and scale the systems, automations, and AI-powered processes that enable n8n's Support teams to deliver exceptional service at scale</strong>, while leading and developing the engineers who make it happen.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">To achieve this, you'll take ownership of four key areas:</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h3>Lead and grow the Support Systems team</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Lead, coach, and develop our Systems &amp; Programs engineers, helping them grow their technical expertise and careers.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Establish a clear team scope, planning processes, and delivery rhythm to ensure consistent execution against priorities.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Support hiring and onboarding while staying close to technical decisions and hands-on problem-solving.</p></li></ul><h3>Own the Support tooling strategy and roadmap</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own the Support tooling portfolio and build a prioritised roadmap that enables Reactive and Proactive Support to scale efficiently.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Establish structured project intake, scoping, and prioritisation processes to focus engineering efforts on the highest-impact opportunities.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Partner with Support leaders and stakeholders across Product, Engineering, Cloud, Security, Legal, Data, Customer Success, Sales, and Partnerships to align priorities and deliver improvements.</p></li></ul><h3>Drive AI-first Support and automation</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Lead the expansion of Nate, our AI-powered Support solution, across Support tiers to increase the share of tickets handled through AI.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Guide the development, maintenance, and adoption of reliable automations, AI agents, and integrations that reduce repetitive work and improve Support efficiency.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Measure the impact of AI and automation through metrics such as time saved, AI-handled ticket share, and cost per AI ticket.</p></li></ul><h3>Build scalable processes and operational foundations</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Rebuild and optimise foundational Support processes, ensuring workflows are efficient, documented, and scalable.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Establish strong governance for standard operating procedures (SOPs), tooling ownership, and automation reliability.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Drive continuous improvement by tracking tooling adoption, SOP compliance, operational efficiency, and capacity freed up for Support teams.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p></li></ul><h2>REQUIREMENTS</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h3><strong>Must-haves</strong></h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Hands-on n8n expertise:</strong> You have practical experience building and maintaining complex workflows and automations using n8n.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Strong technical foundations:</strong> You're comfortable working with APIs, HTTP, authentication, webhooks, and SaaS architecture.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Support systems ownership:</strong> You've owned and improved technical Support systems, tooling, and automations in a B2B SaaS environment.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Engineering leadership:</strong> You have at least 5 years experience leading or mentoring engineers, helping them develop their skills and deliver high-quality work.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Roadmap and stakeholder management:</strong> You can translate business needs into clear technical priorities and align cross-functional stakeholders around a shared roadmap.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>AI and automation expertise:</strong> You have hands-on experience implementing AI agents or AI-assisted Support tooling to improve operational efficiency.</p></li></ul><h3><strong>Nice-to-haves</strong></h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Technical product background:</strong> You've worked as a developer, in DevOps, or on an automation-focused technical product.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Support analytics:</strong> You're familiar with Support performance metrics and have experience using analytics or dashboarding tools such as Hex or Metabase