Paragraph SCXW196870934 BCX0">Design and optimize closed-loop control algorithms for ground-based robotic systems and UAV interactions.</p></li><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW196870934 BCX0">Develop embedded software for sensors, actuators and hardware interfaces.&nbsp;</p></li><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW196870934 BCX0">Integrate cameras, ranging sensors, IMUs, encoders and additional perception sensors into the overall system architecture.</p></li><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW196870934 BCX0">Develop robust sensor fusion algorithms for reliable operation under varying environmental conditions.</p></li><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW196870934 BCX0">Design and validate communication interfaces between the Drone Port, aircraft and cloud infrastructure.</p></li><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW196870934 BCX0">Develop software for autonomous system monitoring, diagnostics and fault detection.</p></li><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW196870934 BCX0">Support hardware bring-up, integration and system validation in laboratory and field environments.</p></li><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW196870934 BCX0">Analyse test results, debug complex system behaviour and continuously improve system robustness.</p></li><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW196870934 BCX0">Collaborate closely with Mechanical, Electrical and Systems Engineering throughout the complete product development lifecycle.</p></li><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW196870934 BCX0">Support flight and field testing of autonomous Drone Port capabilities.</p></li><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW196870934 BCX0">Contribute to software architecture, coding standards and engineering best practices.</p></li><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW196870934 BCX0">Mentor junior engineers and actively contribute to the technical growth of the robotics team.</p></li></ul> <br> <h4><strong><br></strong></h4><h4><strong>What you bring to the team:</strong><br></h4><ul><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW169271172 BCX0">Master's degree or PhD in Robotics, Computer Science, Electrical Engi