&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;London, Warwick, Manchester,&amp;nbsp;Derby&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At BakerHicks, ​​​​​​​our Electrical Services team works with clients across multiple sectors, delivering large and complex projects which require highly resilient power supplies. Specialising in heavily-regulated industries where quality and safety are key, we’re experienced in all aspects of the project lifecycle from definition and feasibility to detailed design and site monitoring.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are actively recruiting across this capability to support a growing portfolio of live projects and welcome applications from Senior and Principal-level contractors to join the team to support the workload.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Electrical Services teams work across a range of UK projects, delivering complex solutions within Nuclear, Defence and other regulated sectors, alongside wider infrastructure and energy environments.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roles are available across multiple locations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Deliver engineering design and consultancy services for BakerHicks under the direction of the line manager or project lead.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Produce design outputs (drawings, specifications, reports), undertake site surveys, support construction stages, liaise with clients and design/construction teams, manage projects, oversee costing, and ensure progress against the project brief.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Check calculations and detailed drawings to ensure designs meet quality standards, compliance requirements, and client expectations.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Work collaboratively with multi‑disciplinary teams to deliver safe, efficient, and buildable solutions.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Maintain an understanding of CDM requirements.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Projects range from early design through to delivery and operational support, providing exposure to technically challenging and safety‑critical environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;9o5f4y&quot; data-start=&quot;95&quot; data-end=&quot;226&quot;&gt;Confidence in producing high-quality designs, with the technical capability to carry out independent checks and ensure accuracy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1iqopol&quot; data-start=&quot;227&quot; data-end=&quot;377&quot;&gt;A strong awareness of commercial considerations, with the ability to identify and flag potential risks or concerns where appropriate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ksehg&quot; data-start=&quot;378&quot; data-end=&quot;565&quot;&gt;A solid understanding of project delivery and people management principles, enabling effective anticipation of challenges and proactive escalation of risks or recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
