ansportation allowances, and other location-specific perks.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">For the most up-to-date details on benefits available in your location, please refer to our <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://app.notion.com/p/mistralai/Benefits-at-Mistral-36e6ba59a7fe836b93dd01737fcc27ef?source=copy_link">Benefits page</a>.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>Privacy Policy</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">Your privacy matters to us. You can learn more about how we handle your personal data in our <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://legal.mistral.ai/terms/applicant-privacy-policy"><u>Applicant Privacy Policy</u></a>.</p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/jobs/companies/mistralai/account-executive-digital-natives-london-364288","tags":["Business"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1794606015},{"slug":"senior-match-3-designer-new-game-london-25645","company_name":"Supercell","title":"Senior Match-3 Designer, New Game","description":"<p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><div style="text-align:left"><img style="max-width:100%" src="https://app.ashbyhq.com/api/images/user-content/1246dead-d30e-4c70-a1d3-ef7e5023d542/2251b9c4-44ce-4ce5-8e1f-2bcd38676418/new%20keyart.jpg" /></div><h3><strong>We’re looking for a talented and highly experienced Senior Match-3 Designer (internally Game Designer) to join our lovely and ambitious game team and help craft fun, rewarding and memorable puzzle experiences for our cozy mobile game.</strong></h3><p style="min-height:1.5em">You’ll own the overall match-3 gameplay experience, helping to define how the puzzle game feels to play while delivering best-in-class levels that strike the right balance of challenge, progression and delight. From core gameplay tuning and mechanic development through to polished, data-informed level iterations, you’ll take ownership of the player experience and continually raise the quality bar.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You’ll work closely with game designers, artists, developers and analysts to ensure the match-3 is satisfying, intuitive and rewarding, evolving its mechanics, pacing and feel so that the game’s creative vision and long-term engagement goals come through. You’ll use player feedback, analytics and playtesting to refine gameplay, experiment with new ideas and shape the ongoing evolution of the game’s core puzzle experience.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">As a senior member of the team, you’ll also help shape our level production strategy, driving quality with both internal development and external partners while contributing to the long-term direction of the game.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><div style="text-align:left"><img style="max-width:100%" src="https://app.ashbyhq.com/api/images/user-content/1246dead-d30e-4c70-a1d3-ef7e5023d542/7a053edc-bf2e-4db4-85ee-5630e2b5d305/banner_narrow_customs.jpg" /></div><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>What You'll Be Doing</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Design, build and balance exceptional match-3 levels that deliver engaging gameplay across a wide range of player skill levels.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Collaborate with developers to tune game feel and match 3 gameplay to be best-in-class</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own the design of blockers, boosters and rewards and shape satisfying level progression</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Use analytics, player feedback and playtesting to continuously refine levels and improve player experience.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Work alongside Engineering to improve level design tools, workflows and implementation processes.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Partner with Art to ensure levels are visually readable, aesthetically cohesive and support the game’s creative vision.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Plan and own Match 3 content production, ensuring a consistent pipeline of high-quality content that supports development milestones and LiveOps.</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Lead external level design contractors and outsourcing partners by providing clear briefs, regular feedback and quality reviews, ensuring all delivered content meets Treefrog’s standards.</p></li></ul></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Mentor other designers through feedback, knowledge sharing and collaborative problem solving.</p></li></ul><h2>What You Have</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience shipping successful free-to-play match-3 or puzzle games.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience designing LiveOps events, seasonal content or limited-time game modes.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong understanding of player progression, retention, engagement and monetisation in puzzle.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience improving level editors, pipelines or content creation workflows.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience leading small feature teams or mentoring designers.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Have a deep understanding of the competition and genre trends.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Passion for cosy games and creating emotionally engaging player experiences.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A self-starter approach to use AI: you've found ways to use it in your day-to-day work, you experiment, figure things out and bring the same energy to every new challenge.</p></li></ul><h2>What We're Looking for</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A strong sense of ownership, with the ability to drive work forward autonomously.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A consistent track record of delivering high-quality work that meets design requirements and project goals.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A proactive mindset, with the ability to identify opportunities and solve problems.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Sound judgement in balancing creative excellence with production efficiency.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">The ability to lead external partners with clarity, empathy and high standards.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A collaborative approach to sharing knowledge, mentoring designers and raising the team’s quality bar.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Clear communication skills and the confidence to constructively challenge decisions.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A player-first mindset, balanced with an understanding of creative, technical and commercial goals.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A commitment to fostering a collaborative, inclusive and positive team culture.</p></li></ul><h2>Where You'll Be</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">This role is based in our London office. The team values in-person collaboration and typically works from the office three days a week: Mondays, Tuesdays and Fridays.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">–––</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em>That's it about the role! Below, we've gathered some things we feel are important for you to know. Totally optional, but a highly recommended read. </em></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em>Once you're ready to apply, just send us your application through the form on the bottom of the page. </em></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em>–––</em></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><div style="text-align:left"><img style="max-width:100%" src="https://app.ashbyhq.com/api/images/user-content/1246dead-d30e-4c70-a1d3-ef7e5023d542/88b3477a-7124-479e-babc-94125c5b23be/banner_narrow_allstars.jpg" /></div><h3>About Supercell </h3><p style="min-height:1.5em">Supercell is a games company from Helsinki, Finland, with <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://supr.cl/jd-offices">offices</a> also in San Francisco, Seoul, Shanghai, and London. You might know us as the makers of <em>Hay Day, Clash of Clans, Boom Beach, Clash Royale, and Brawl Stars</em>. Our mission is to create <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://supr.cl/jd-games">great games</a> that as many people as possible play for years and that are remembered forever.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">So, how do we make great games? By putting together the best teams and giving them the freedom and independence to succeed. And by taking risks, <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://supercell.com/en/news/learning-from-failures/">failing, sharing learnings</a>, and killing lots of projects. </p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><div style="text-align:left"><img style="max-width:100%" src="https://app.ashbyhq.com/api/images/user-content/1246dead-d30e-4c70-a1d3-ef7e5023d542/0272a5b3-a7a2-4f1c-b97b-725eae66daf0/banner_narrow_people3.jpg" /></div><h3>Hey, You Might Love It Here!</h3><p style="min-height:1.5em">Independent cells and trust are at the core of <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://supr.cl/jd-why-you">our culture</a>. But it takes more than that to make great games. We take good care of our people, providing them with the compensation, work environment, and resources they need to succeed while having fun along the way.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><div style="text-align:left"><img style="max-width:100%" src="https://app.ashbyhq.com/api/images/user-content/1246dead-d30e-4c70-a1d3-ef7e5023d542/49ae2117-cfbb-4fbd-bc4c-f67357d2f376/banner_narrow_titles.jpg" /></div><h3>You Are Not Your Job Title ™</h3><p style="min-height:1.5em">Here, you won’t need to focus on <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://supr.cl/jd-job-title">chasing titles</a> or climbing ladders. Internally, our job titles don’t include prefixes like Senior, Junior, Principal, or Director. Recognition isn’t tied to your title, as it doesn't define the impact you can have around here.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><div style="text-align:left"><img style="max-width:100%" src="https://app.ashbyhq.com/api/images/user-content/1246dead-d30e-4c70-a1d3-ef7e5023d542/860d5de4-aa96-4e01-879c-889b7039330b/banner_narrow_chest.jpg" /></div><h3>Benefits and Compensation </h3><p style="min-height:1.5em">Luring you in with glitter, glamour, and gems isn't what we're about. We want you to enjoy your time here fully, so we structure <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://supr.cl/jd-benefits">our compensation and benefits</a> with that in mind. It starts with perceiving you as a human being, not a resource.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><div style="text-align:left"><img style="max-width:100%" src="https://app.ashbyhq.com/api/images/user-content/1246dead-d30e-4c70-a1d3-ef7e5023d542/b52ac2fb-3f94-46bc-9c36-32ad780b2eae/banner_narrow_relocating.jpg" /></div><h3>Relocation? Yes!</h3><p style="min-height:1.5em">No matter where you’re moving from, our dedicated mobility team and partners will support you throughout your move. We’ll ensure the process is as smooth as possible for you and anyone joining you – whether they’re family members of the human or animal kind!</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><div style="text-align:left"><img style="max-width:100%" src="https://app.ashbyhq.com/api/images/user-content/1246dead-d30e-4c70-a1d3-ef7e5023d542/58a0cf4e-e26b-461b-8541-2129dc6b7311/banner_narrow_portraits-2025-ashby.jpg" /></div><h3>Not Sure if You Should Apply? </h3><p style="min-height:1.5em">Many candidates with great skills and experience second-guess themselves. The bar is high, but if this role excites you, apply! We’re here to help you succeed. Also, we're happy to learn about any specific accommodations you may need to fully engage in our recruitment process.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Wishing you all the best,<br />The Supercell Recruitment team</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><div><div style="left:0px;width:100%;height:0px;position:relative;padding-bottom:56.25%"><iframe src="https://embedded-media.ashbyhq.com/embed/1246dead-d30e-4c70-a1d3-ef7e5023d542/f7b3a9e7-5942-4fe2-9e3a-2382205d9d49" style="top:0px;left:0px;width:100%;height:100%;position:absolute;border:0px" allowfullscreen="true" scrolling="no" allow="encrypted-media *; picture-in-picture *;" sandbox="allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-presentation"></iframe></div></div><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/jobs/companies/supercell/senior-match-3-designer-new-game-london-25645","tags":["New Games"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1794606015},{"slug":"deputy-chief-sub-editor-homes-luxury-london-greater-london-55993","company_name":"Hearst","title":"Deputy Chief Sub Editor, Homes & Luxury","description":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are the UK&#39;s leading premium publisher, home to iconic and influential media brands including Esquire, Men&#39;s &amp;amp; Women&#39;s Health, ELLE, Good Housekeeping, Harper&#39;s Bazaar, Digital Spy, Cosmopolitan, Red and more. At Hearst UK, we don&#39;t just create content – we shape culture.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Our workplace is driven by passion, shaped by authenticity and powered by creativity. We back bold ideas, act with an entrepreneurial mindset and continually evolve to meet the moment – while respecting the legacy that&#39;s brought us here. We believe in each other&#39;s potential and push boundaries together to create meaningful impact, both across the media landscape and in people&#39;s lives.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We&#39;re proud of our heritage – but even more excited about making history.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Hearst UK operates an in-office policy with flexible Fridays. Our office is based at &lt;strong&gt;House of Hearst, 30 Panton Street, St James&#39;s, London, SW1Y 4AJ&lt;/strong&gt;, where teams collaborate in person and connect across brands and functions.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary – Circa £30,000&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Salary is dependent on experience and will be assessed in line with the candidate&#39;s skills, knowledge and relevant expertise.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;The Role...&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As one of two Deputy chief sub-editors on the Luxury &amp;amp; Homes Subbing Hub, you will sub-edit content for six of the country’s most elegant and polished publications (&lt;em&gt;Country Living&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em&gt;ELLE&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em&gt;ELLE Decoration&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em&gt;Esquire&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em&gt;Harper’s Bazaar&lt;/em&gt; and &lt;em&gt;House Beautiful&lt;/em&gt;), as well as fact-checking, proof-reading and signing-off pages. You will also assist and, when necessary, deputise for, the Chief sub-editors in overseeing the subbing and production process, from copy stage through to sending pages to press.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Main Duties...&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Subbing raw copy (checking facts, spelling and grammar) and fitting layouts for all pages of &lt;em&gt;Country Living&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em&gt;ELLE&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em&gt;ELLE Decoration&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em&gt;Esquire&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em&gt;Harper’s Bazaar&lt;/em&gt; and &lt;em&gt;House Beautiful&lt;/em&gt; magazines, along with any additional editorial or commercial content that arises during the production cycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Composing compelling display copy in keeping with house styles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensuring that pages meet the brands’ high standards in terms of tone and accuracy, upholding the brands’ unique tone and evolving it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sending layouts for legal checks when necessary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Liaising with Editorial, Art, Pictures, Marketing, Digital and Subscriptions departments over relevant pages to ensure they meet requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deputising for the Chief sub-editors when necessary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What We Are Looking For...&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Essential&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have great accuracy and attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be organised and calm under pressure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be capable of handling several tasks at once.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be an excellent problem solver and team player with good initiative.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Benefits&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your benefits at Hearst UK are more than just extras – they are tools to help you thrive in every part of life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Hearst Exclusives – Only for You!&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Get adventurous with Good Housekeeping Taste and Beauty Testing Panels – yes, you could be trying the next big thing in beauty, food and drink.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Snag luxe beauty steals at our legendary office sample sales – score big on top brands without breaking the bank!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Inclusion, Health &amp;amp; Wellbeing&amp;nbsp;–&amp;nbsp;Feel Your Best&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay healthy with Specsavers eye care, a company-funded Health Cash Plan and access to mental health support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Get active and stress-free with discounted gym memberships and the Cycle to Work scheme.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embrace flexibility with Location Flex and Holiday Exchange to take time when you need it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take time to give back with a Charity Day and access wellbeing resources whenever you need them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Join one of our Hearst ERG groups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Financial Wellness – Boost Your Budget&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan ahead with a generous Workplace Pension, Income Protection, Life Assurance and Season Ticket Loan for easier commuting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make smarter money moves using Salary Finance tools, Financial Wellbeing sessions and Home Tech benefits to spread costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Treat yourself with major discounts across London plus everyday savings via the HAPI at Hearst app.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hearst UK is deeply committed to using our influential brands to reflect the world we want to live in – one that respects, protects, represents and uplifts the voices and opinions of all people. As a business, we recognise the significant benefits of creativity, collaboration and innovation that come with diverse teams. Not only is diversifying the voices in our organisation the right thing to do, but it also helps us create powerful and exciting content that can be enjoyed by many more people. This is why we&#39;re working to build a sense of true belonging within our business and foster a culture in which everyone feels heard.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/jobs/companies/hearst/deputy-chief-sub-editor-homes-luxury-london-greater-london-55993","tags":["National Magazine Co"],"job_types":[],"location":"LONDON, Greater London","created_at":1794596130},{"slug":"analytics-manager-london-399563","company_name":"Moniepoint","title":"Analytics Manager","description":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Moniepoint Inc. is Africa’s all-in-one financial platform, helping 20 million businesses and individuals access seamless payments, banking, credit, cross-border, and business management tools each month.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Nigeria’s largest merchant acquirer, we power most of the country’s point-of-sale (POS) transactions. Through our subsidiaries, Moniepoint Inc. processes over $250 billion in digital payment transaction value annually.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Moniepoint, as an Analytics Manager, you will use data to make better decisions, faster for the business. You will own metrics, measurement, experimentation and the analysis/data roadmap for a business area. You’ll use data to quantify business KPIs and conduct analyses to uncover unknowns, helping the business unit achieve its goals for acquisition, conversion, activation, retention, and revenue. As a leader of the business unit, the role sits at the intersection of product management, data engineering, and growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic Leadership: Build a disciplined, exceptional analytical team. Develop and execute a comprehensive data and analytics roadmap and strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team Building &amp;amp; Management: Hire, develop, and retain a high-performing team of analytics professionals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data Insights &amp;amp; Analytics - including forecast building, business analysis and model development and productionisation. Drive the generation of actionable insights from data to support various business functions, including product, operations, marketing and engineering. What is our actual CAC per channel? Which customer segments are more/less engaged? What are our customers’ share of wallet - how can we use this? What is the typical behaviour of a Moniepoint consumer? What products cause the biggest incremental engagement?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stakeholder Collaboration: Partner with growth, product, and engineering managers to ensure we collect the right data for meaningful business insights. Bring data leadership and rigour to our approach to product development. Build a strategic understanding of the business and structure complex projects to bring them to life.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business: Growth&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and maintain the yearly forecast and budget for your products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the product&#39;s growth plan and lead execution across the entire funnel from acquisition through to monetisation and retention&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and optimise specific business metrics or commercial goals, covering the entire funnel from new user acquisition through conversion, activation, retention, and expansion&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.productled.org/foundations/the-rise-of-the-growth-product-manager&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform detailed product analysis covering the product management funnel with all its aspects, implementing changes into the buying funnel to improve conversion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and execute A/B testing programs to optimise sales and conversion rates/adoption at each funnel stage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead testing and optimisation efforts for the conversion funnel across offline and online channels, prioritising tests that drive the biggest business impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve the product&#39;s design and deploy experiments to improve lifetime value (LTV) and decrease churn&lt;a href=&quot;https://medium.com/swlh/who-are-growth-product-managers-43626ffed444&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical: Data &amp;amp; Analytics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use deep, flexible, and comprehensive analytics covering the entire funnel from marketing acquisition to product usage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse user behaviour to improve the sales funnel and increase conversions, using advanced analytics to assess campaign performance and refine strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and track growth metrics including customer acquisition cost (CAC), activation rate, retention rate, payback time, and revenue per customer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct cohort analysis and journey mapping to identify bottlenecks and optimisation opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you need to succeed&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;+5 years in Analytics and Analytics Management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years in a management role managing teams and driving strategic initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record in a consumer-FMCG environment, preferably in a CPG or fintech environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep experience scaling product businesses, with demonstrated ownership of significant revenue targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills with ability to drive metrics and benchmarks, plus experience with growth experiments, A/B testing, and funnel optimisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep SQL knowledge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in product analytics tools (Mixpanel, Grafana, Tableau, Looker, etc)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of data analytics, user behaviour analysis and segmentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership &amp;amp; Soft Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills to interact with teams, stakeholders, and users through verbal presentations, written reports, and visual media&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hotjar.com/growth-product-management/growth-product-manager/&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to build, mentor, and scale high-performing product teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in data analytics tools and digital marketing platforms with the ability to manage and mentor teams of marketers, analysts, and designers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic thinker with strong commercial awareness and business acumen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Performance Indicators&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;User acquisition and activation rates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer retention and churn rates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expansion revenue (upsell/cross-sell)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer Lifetime Value (LTV) / Customer Acquisition Cost (CAC) ratio&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product adoption metrics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What sets you apart&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced degree in Business or STEM&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in Growth Analytics, Product analytics, Credit risk analytics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in both mass-marketing and product-led growth models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing P&amp;amp;L or budget responsibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll get&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Culture - We put our people first and prioritise the well-being of every team member. We’ve built a company where all opinions carry weight and where all voices are heard. We value and respect each other and always look out for one another. Above all, we are human.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning - We have a learning and development-focused environment with an emphasis on knowledge sharing, training, and regular internal technical talks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compensation - You’ll receive an attractive salary, pension, health insurance, annual bonus, plus other benefits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What to expect in the hiring process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Online SQL take-home task &lt;em&gt;(30 mins): &lt;/em&gt;Take-home test.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business Case 1 &lt;em&gt;(1 hour - 1 hour 30 mins)&lt;/em&gt;: Live case. No take-home required.&lt;/li&gt;
