&lt;/ul&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/jobs/companies/moniepoint/analytics-manager-london-399563","tags":["Marketing & Sales"],"job_types":[],"location":"London","created_at":1794596129},{"slug":"account-executive-416995","company_name":"Zone & Co","title":"Account Executive","description":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Zone &amp;amp; Company Software Consulting LLC (“Zone”) is the ERP-native AI platform for financial operations, purpose-built for organizations running on Oracle NetSuite. We are redefining how finance teams operate by delivering an AI-powered system that automates, connects, and scales financial workflows directly within the ERP.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the AI operating system for finance teams in NetSuite, Zone enables more than 4,500 customers worldwide to run smarter, faster, and with greater accuracy. Our platform spans the full financial lifecycle, including Quote-to-Cash, Procure-to-Pay, Treasury, Payroll Management, and Record-to-Report, eliminating manual processes and unlocking real-time financial intelligence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By embedding intelligence directly into NetSuite, Zone helps finance teams move beyond reactive work to proactive, strategic impact. Learn more at&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.zoneandco.com&quot;&gt; www.zoneandco.com&lt;/a&gt; or follow us on LinkedIn:&lt;a href=&quot;http://linkedin.com/company/zoneandco&quot;&gt; linkedin.com/company/zoneandco&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x12ofw9d&quot;&gt;Zone &amp;amp; Co. is looking for a high-velocity Account Executive to sell finance automation solutions to the Office of the CFO. We move fast, set ambitious goals, and expect our team to deliver. Our targets are designed to be achievable, and we&#39;re looking for disciplined, driven sellers who know how to manage a pipeline, maintain deal momentum, and consistently convert opportunities into closed business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x12ofw9d&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll own pipeline generation through strategic outbound prospecting, complemented by additional opportunities from our partner ecosystem and marketing team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x12ofw9d&quot;&gt;If you thrive in a fast-paced sales environment, are comfortable navigating short sales cycles, bring rigor to your MEDDPICC process, and enjoy building relationships face-to-face with partners and customers, this could be the opportunity for you. You&#39;ll also have the chance to develop deep expertise across a broad and growing product portfolio in a dynamic, expanding market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own a net new number. &lt;/strong&gt;Win new logos across a defined EMEA territory against an annual ARR target, measured monthly and quarterly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build your own pipeline. &lt;/strong&gt;Outbound is part of the job, every week: calls, sequences, LinkedIn, and your own network. Partner and marketing leads are a bonus, not the plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Get out there. &lt;/strong&gt;Travel to partner offices, industry events, and customer meetings. Face time with partners and clients is key.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work the partner ecosystem. &lt;/strong&gt;Build trusted relationships with our implementation and referral partners so they bring you in early and back you to close.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Run a high-velocity motion. &lt;/strong&gt;Manage 30 + active opportunities at once and close 10–15 deals a month, from first call through pricing, paper process and signature.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sell with discipline. &lt;/strong&gt;Use MEDDPICC on every deal: find the pain, the metrics and the economic buyer, build a champion, and run a clear close plan with a next step every time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sell the whole journey.&lt;/strong&gt; We are positioning the complete end-to-end story. We want to connect the customer pain with how to solve finance challenges, and turn that vision into bigger, multi-product wins.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner with Solution Consulting. &lt;/strong&gt;Bring in SCs at the right moment for sharp, tailored demos on larger deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Forecast accurately. &lt;/strong&gt;Keep Salesforce clean and call your number with confidence every week.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What success looks like:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You consistently hit, and regularly beat, your monthly and quarterly ARR targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your pipeline is a good mix of self-sourced and partner-sourced from relationships you&#39;ve built.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partners know you by name and bring you into their deals early.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your deals are MEDDPICC-complete, your forecast is reliable, and your average deal size grows as you sell more of the platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years closing net new SaaS business, with a track record of hitting and overachieving ARR targets in a fast-paced, transactional or mid-market motion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A real outbound habit: you prospect daily and you&#39;re proud of the pipeline you create yourself.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong MEDDPICC (or MEDDIC) skills, applied for real, not just known.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercial acumen: you understand ROI, pricing and negotiation, and you&#39;re comfortable talking value with finance leaders and CFOs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling to the Office of the CFO AP Automation, Procure-to-Pay, billing, payments or order-to-cash, is a big plus. NetSuite ecosystem experience is a bonus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A diligent, organised approach: you manage a busy pipeline without dropping the detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A keen eye to learn. Our product set grows through innovation and acquisition, and you&#39;ll want to master new products fast.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Happy on the road: comfortable travelling to partner sites, events and client meetings across the UK and EMEA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident with Salesforce, Gong and modern sales tools. As well as AI tools such as Clay and Claude.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Zone, we provide the platform; you provide the grit. We operate as a high-velocity, fully remote, global team where autonomy isn&#39;t just a perk, it’s the standard. We’re looking for self-driven professionals eager to navigate the complexities of a unique SaaS environment and take full command of their professional evolution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We ditch micro-management for high-trust flexibility, ensuring you have the space to innovate and scale. Our benefits are built to fuel this lifestyle, supporting your life beyond the screen so you can focus on making a global impact. Explore our offerings at &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.zoneandco.com/careers&quot;&gt;https://www.zoneandco.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join Our Global Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zone &amp;amp; Co is an Equal Opportunity Employer committed to building a diverse, equitable, and inclusive workplace. We thrive on unique perspectives and strongly encourage candidates of all backgrounds to apply. Here, your identity is valued, and your talent is the only limit to your growth. All qualified applicants will receive consideration regardless of race, color, religion, sex, orientation, age, disability, or any other protected factor.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employment Terms&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;United States&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Employment with Zone is &lt;strong&gt;“At-Will”&lt;/strong&gt;, meaning either party may terminate the relationship at any time, with or without cause or notice, in accordance with applicable law. This job description does not constitute an employment contract or guarantee of continued employment. Duties and responsibilities may evolve as the company grows and may change at any time with or without notice.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Non-US Jurisdictions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is offered as a Fixed-Term or Permanent Contract based on your country of residence.&amp;nbsp; Employment is subject to a written contract which outlines specific notice periods, probationary terms, and statutory entitlements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.zoneandco.com/legal/privacy&quot;&gt;Privacy Statement&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://21166970.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/21166970/Website%20Downloads/Legal/Applicant%20Privacy%20Notice.pdf&quot;&gt;Applicant Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/jobs/companies/zone-co/account-executive-416995","tags":["Direct Sales"],"job_types":[],"location":"","created_at":1794596128},{"slug":"senior-product-data-scientist-london-367308","company_name":"Deliveroo","title":"Senior Product Data Scientist","description":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Join us in our mission to transform the way people shop and eat, where impact, innovation and growth drive everything we do. Our Analytics organisation sits at the heart of Deliveroo powering decision-making across product, commercial and operations through experimentation and causal inference.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Data Scientist&lt;/strong&gt; to join our &lt;strong&gt;London&lt;/strong&gt; team (working hybrid, 3 days in the office). In this role, you’ll enable high-quality human-led decision-making to maximise impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re hiring multiple Senior Data Scientists across different areas of the business. Rather than hiring for one fixed team, we use the interview process to understand your strengths, interests and development areas, and then align you to the right scope, remit and team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Our Analytics Organisation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have an outstanding analytics organisation, with a mission to enable the highest quality human and machine decision-making.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our community is highly active, with guest lectures, study groups, mentorship programmes and a robust technical review process. Data Scientists can progress equally as technical leads or people managers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our data scientists come from all kinds of backgrounds but have excellence in common. Many are formally trained in data science, many are not.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will help answer questions like:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Which markets/cities should we enter next?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;How can we incentivise good rider behaviour?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What is the impact of exclusive deals we have with restaurants?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;How do we optimise our compensation policy to keep our customers happy and ordering with Deliveroo?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What are the trade-offs we face when choosing between growth and profitability? How should we decide between them?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;How much should our pricing vary by distance and by market?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What is the optimum selection and variety of restaurants in a particular area?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;How do we adapt our consumer app to better suit grocery shoppers?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Need to Thrive&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Significant experience in Data Science (or similar) roles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience leading both simple and more complex experiment designs, with the ability to proactively unpick insights to steer strategic decision making&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Great communication skills - in person, in writing, in code; to technical and non-technical audiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Through solid analysis, provide clear and actionable recommendations that influence the team&#39;s roadmap.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Effective problem-solving, demonstrating an ability to successfully address complex and ambiguous challenges.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ability to think creatively and insightfully about business problems&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proficiency with analytical tools like R/Python and familiarity with SQL. Proficiency with Cursor/AI tools to deliver impactful, high-quality work efficiently is also valued&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A pragmatic, flexible approach, where you most care about achieving impact&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Excellent people skills — you&#39;ll be meeting with a range of both technical and non-technical stakeholders to translate business needs into data science problems&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, you’ll do work that matters, solving real-world problems in a three-sided marketplace that’s constantly evolving. We’re food lovers, problem solvers, community builders and more, brought together by a shared drive to make things better. Working here you can expect to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🔧 &lt;strong&gt;Solve meaningful problems at real scale&lt;/strong&gt; Work on a complex, always-on marketplace that impacts millions every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌱 &lt;strong&gt;See your impact, fast&lt;/strong&gt; Ship, test and improve ideas quickly in a low-hierarchy, high-ownership environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🧠 &lt;strong&gt;Grow through challenge and ownership&lt;/strong&gt; Take on big, ambiguous problems and accelerate your career with strong support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌎 &lt;strong&gt;A culture built for builders&lt;/strong&gt; High standards, collaboration, flexible working and continuous learning.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;​​💰 &lt;strong&gt;Share in the success you help create&lt;/strong&gt; Competitive salary and equity options, so you’re rewarded for the impact you make.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We aim to create a fair process that lets your skills shine—our interview typically includes 3-4 stages. Find more about&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.deliveroo.co.uk/how-we-hire/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt; &lt;u&gt;how we hire here&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/jobs/companies/deliveroo/senior-product-data-scientist-london-367308","tags":["Data Analytics (Ads)"],"job_types":[],"location":"London","created_at":1794596127},{"slug":"senior-operations-representative-compliance-london-386642","company_name":"Deliveroo","title":"Senior Operations Representative Compliance","description":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About the team&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a talented individual to join our Rider Onboarding and Compliance Team. This is a bustling and vibrant team that helps applicants become riders to ensure we have enough riders in the fleet to supply customer demand and proactively ensure riders remain in service and compliant during their time with Deliveroo. This is the perfect opportunity to join an exciting, fast-growing business and expand your operational abilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will report to the Rider Compliance Team Lead and collaborate with the Rider Compliance Team to proactively ensure riders remain in-service and compliant by effectively and efficiently managing compliance pipelines. In collaboration with the Rider Compliance Senior team, you will be responsible for reducing rider downtime resulting from compliance processes and ensuring Deliveroo is compliant with local laws at all times&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Accurately load riders to compliance sweeps to ensure we have valid and compliant rider information and documentation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Monitor the rider compliance flows to ensure minimal friction in the process&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Provide SME compliance knowledge to Deliveroo team to ensure we successfully launch in new markets and our fleet remains compliant&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Manage vendor compliance queues to ensure that compliance cases are reviewed and actioned efficiently&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop and provide SME market-specific compliance knowledge to our vendors and internal teams&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Respond to internal and external compliance escalations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ensure the Rider Compliance Team process and training documentation is up-to-date&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Provide comprehensive training to new starters and our vendors&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Collaborate with the Compliance Team to identify opportunities for reducing inefficiencies within our processes&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Collaborate with the broader Rider Compliance Team to achieve KPIs and targets&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proactively identify, investigate and take appropriate actions to mitigate rider compliance risk within our fleet or processes&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Requirements&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are proficient in written and spoken English&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are an excellent and confident communicator&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are highly organised&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are detail-oriented&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are a strong team player&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are happy working in a fast-paced environment and can easily adapt to change&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are self-motivated and eager to learn&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are curious and can challenge processes that aren’t working -- you get to the bottom of things&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are familiar with G-Sheets or Excel (can maintain complex spreadsheets).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience using Salesforce&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why Deliveroo&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission is to transform the way you shop and eat, bringing the neighbourhood to your door by connecting consumers, restaurants, shops and riders. We are transforming the way the world eats and shops by making access to food and products more convenient and enjoyable. We give people the opportunity to buy what they want, as they want it, when and where they want it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are a technology-driven company at the forefront of the most rapidly expanding industry in the world. We are still a small team, making a very large impact, looking to answer some of the most interesting questions out there. We move fast, value autonomy and ownership, and we are always looking for new ideas.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Workplace &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo we know that people are the heart of the business and we prioritise their welfare. Benefits differ by country, but we offer many benefits in areas including healthcare, well-being, parental leave, pensions, and generous annual leave allowances, including time off to support a charitable cause of your choice. Benefits are country-specific, please ask your recruiter for more information.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/jobs/companies/deliveroo/senior-operations-representative-compliance-london-386642","tags":["Rider Services"],"job_types":[],"location":"London","created_at":1794596127},{"slug":"senior-grc-engineer-london-333149","company_name":"Deliveroo","title":"Senior GRC Engineer","description":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Come help us build the world&#39;s most trusted on-demand logistics engine for delivery! We&#39;re building a team of great minds to help us secure and maintain a 24x7, no-downtime, global infrastructure system that powers DoorDash’s multi-sided marketplace of consumers, merchants, and drivers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re hiring a Senior GRC Engineer to help take DoorDash&#39;s compliance program from something people run to something the platform runs on its own. Reporting to the Security Compliance Manager, you&#39;ll take primary ownership of how regulatory and framework change gets tracked, interpreted, and turned into real controls - one part of a broader GRC function that spans audit, policy, and risk. Day to day, that means less time updating spreadsheets and more time writing the automation, integrations, and control logic that let audit evidence collect itself. You&#39;ll also lead major external audits from start to finish and help shape the policies and control standards the rest of the program is built on.This is a hands-on role for someone who already has deep audit and assurance experience, wants to spend more time building than briefing and can move a program forward, and change how people work, without needing the title to make it happen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’re excited about this opportunity because you will…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the regulatory and framework change-management process that keeps DoorDash ahead of new obligations, instead of reacting to them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Move manual, point-in-time compliance work onto Compliance-as-Code foundations: policy-as-code, automated control testing, and continuous evidence collection wired into CI/CD, so audit readiness holds up between audits, not just during them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and run agentic workflows for evidence analysis, control testing, and audit response preparation, with a human in the loop where assurance demands it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner directly with engineering and architecture teams to design controls into new systems at build time and translate that technical work into the narratives auditors actually need.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the Security Compliance Manager to shape and mature the global compliance program.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, implement and validate security controls relevant to DoorDash’s regulatory environment, not just document them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support development and refinement of security policies, standards, and guidance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor other members of the compliance team and help set the technical bar the rest of the function grows into.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure policies are actionable, testable, and aligned to real-world controls.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re excited about you because you have…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in security compliance, GRC or technology risk, with a strong track record in high-growth, technology-driven and regulated environments.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience building large language models and agent workflows with daily use of AI in your own work, grounded judgment on what to delegate to agents versus what needs a human, and the ability to evidence both to an auditor. DoorDash is an AI-forward organization and the ability to optimize efficiency using AI is crucial in this role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ideal candidate brings hands-on experience with frameworks such as DORA, the EU AI Act, NIS2 and CRA.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Real, hands-on experience implementing and assessing controls against frameworks like PCI DSS, SOC 2, ISO 27001 - not just reading them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to identify control gaps, assess risk and drive remediation in partnership with cross-functional stakeholders.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing, implementing and improving security policies, standards, and procedures, ensuring they are operational and effective.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of compliance metrics and reporting, with the ability to track control effectiveness, audit outcomes, and risk exposure.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to influence and drive accountability across technical and non-technical stakeholders.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills, with the ability to translate complex audit and compliance requirements into clear, actionable guidance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort owning compliance metrics and reporting - you can show, not just assert, that a program is working.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Information Security, Computer Science, or related field, or equivalent practical experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
