orkshops, design sessions, and hands-on trainings that accelerate time-to-value</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Proactively communicate product updates, new capabilities, and innovative use cases to maximize customer value realization</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Provide Expert Technical Support</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Diagnose and resolve platform issues through systematic troubleshooting, documenting problems clearly and coordinating with Engineering on appropriate resolution paths</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Develop deep platform expertise that enables you to answer complex technical questions and guide customers through sophisticated workflows</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Create feedback loops that ensure technical issues inform long-term product improvements</p></li></ul><h2><strong>Who You Are</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Essential Qualifications</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">8+ years of customer success, management consulting, partnerships, account management, or implementation experience in pharmaceutical, biopharma, biotech, or life sciences industries</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Working knowledge of drug development processes, portfolio management, and deal evaluation frameworks</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Demonstrated ability to navigate complex, multi-stakeholder decision-making within large enterprise organizations</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong technical aptitude, with the ability to quickly master sophisticated software platforms and translate technical capabilities into business value</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Exceptional executive communication skills</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Entrepreneurial mindset with comfort operating in fast-paced, high-growth environments where priorities evolve quickly</p></li></ul><div style="min-