</li>
<li><p>Familiarity with large-scale data processing, data analysis and visualisation, as well as agile development and DevOps.</p>
</li>
<li><p>Hands-on experience with or interest in technologies such as Spark, Delta Lake, Airflow, Kafka, Kubernetes or Terraform.</p>
