, negotiation, and hiring handoffs while delivering timely, transparent candidate communication.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListBullet">Independently prioritize competing requisitions, manage calendars and deadlines, maintain strong follow-through, and adapt quickly to changing business needs.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListBullet">Maintain accurate ATS records and provide regular reporting on pipeline health, time-to-fill, sourcing effectiveness, bottlenecks, and hiring progress.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListBullet">Use recruiting technology, AI-assisted tools, and appropriate automation to improve sourcing and execution efficiency while preserving sound judgment and human oversight.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListBullet">Ensure hiring activities comply with relevant country-specific employment requirements, GDPR, data privacy standards, and DeepHealth policies.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListBullet">Partner with the global People and Communications teams to strengthen DeepHealth’s employer brand across European markets.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListBullet">Plan and deliver local talent-attraction initiatives, such as recruitment events, university or professional-community partnerships, networking activities and employee referral campaigns.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListBullet">Build relationships with local universities, professional associations and talent communities to develop pipelines for priority roles.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListBullet">Represent DeepHealth professionally and communicate its mission and employer value proposition throughout the candidate journey.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="MsoNormal"><strong>PLEASE NOTE: </strong>This is not an exhaustive list of all duties, responsibilities and requirements of the position. Other functions may be assigned and management retains the right to add or change duties at any time.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p> <br> <p class="MsoNormal"><strong>Minimum Qualifications, Education and Experience</strong></p><ul><li><p class="MsoListBullet">5+ years of progressive, hands-on full-cycle Talent Acquisition experience, including substantial recruiting experience within B2B SaaS organizations (required).</p></li><li><p class="MsoListBullet">Demonstrated experience recruiting across multiple European countries and navigating differences in talent markets, employment practices, and hiring processes (required).</p></li><li><p class="MsoListBullet">Proven ability to manage a high volume of varied, complex requisitions across multiple job families rather than repeated hiring for a single profile (required).</p></li><li><p class="MsoListBullet">Experience recruiting technical roles such as Software Engineering, Cloud/DevOps, Product, Data Science, or AI/ML, alongside commercial or corporate functions (required).</p></li><li><p class="MsoListBullet">Strong direct sourcing capability, including passive candidate engagement and role-specific market mapping (required).</p></li><li><p class="MsoListBullet">Demonstrated ability to build strategic relationships with hiring managers and senior stakeholders, advise on hiring strategy, and influence decisions (required).</p></li><li><p class="MsoListBullet">Exceptional time management, prioritization, organization, communication, and attention to detail (required).</p></li><li><p class="MsoListBullet">Experience with applicant tracking systems, LinkedIn Recruiter, recruiting metrics, and modern sourcing tools (required).</p></li><li><p class="MsoListBullet">Professional fluency in written and spoken English and ability to collaborate across international time zones (required).</p></li><li><p class="MsoListBullet">Experience developing employer-brand activity or delivering local talent-attraction initiatives, such as recruitment events, university partnerships, professional-community engagement or employee advocacy (preferred).</p></li><li><p class="MsoListBullet">Experience recruiting into the United States, Canada, and APAC (preferred).</p></li><li><p class="MsoListBullet">Experience in healthcare technology, enterprise imaging, PACS/RIS, radiology software, or clinical AI (preferred).</p></li><li><p class="MsoListBullet">Experience supporting global SaaS organizations, including Employer of Record arrangements, and familiarity with Recruitee or comparable ATS platforms (preferred).</p></li><li><p class="MsoListBullet">Additional European language proficiency (preferred).</p></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal" style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="MsoNormal"><strong>Quality Standards</strong></p><ul><li><p class="MsoListBullet">Communicates and collaborates professionally with colleagues, candidates, hiring managers, and external partners.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListBullet">Demonstrates initiative, integrity, discretion, accountability, and confidentiality in all areas of performance.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListBullet">Follows applicable local, regional, and country employment laws, including data privacy requirements.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListBullet">Follows all DeepHealth policies, procedures, safety, and compliance standards.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListBullet">Adapts to new priorities, tools, systems, and ways of working.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListBullet"> Completes responsibilities accurately, efficiently, and within agreed timelines.</p></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal" style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="MsoNormal"><strong>Travel</strong></p><p class="MsoNormal">This position may require occasional global travel of up to 10%, based on business needs.</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="MsoNormal"><strong>Working Environment</strong></p><p class="MsoNormal">Remote (Europe); specific employing country and work arrangement subject to confirmation.</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="MsoNormal"><strong>Physical Demands</strong></p><p class="MsoNormal">The employee must be able to perform the essential duties and responsibilities of the position, with or without reasonable accommodation.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>Compensation:</p><p>France 50,000-60,000K EURO</p><p>Netherlands 65,000-75,000K EURO</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":true,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/deephealth/remote-talent-acquisition-partner-europe-amsterdam-rotterdam-370843","tags":["People","Remote"],"job_types":["Mid","fulltime permanent"],"location":"Remote job","created_at":1794594677},{"slug":"meewerkstage-project-engineering-rijssen-115361","company_name":"Voortman Steel Machinery","title":"Meewerkstage: Project Engineering","description":"<h2>Wat ga je doen?</h2><p>Tijdens deze meewerkstage Project Engineering werk je mee aan echte klantprojecten binnen de machinebouw. Je ondersteunt bij de technische uitwerking van machineconfiguraties en helpt ervoor te zorgen dat de klantvraag goed wordt vertaald naar Engineering en Productie. Daarbij krijg je te maken met mechanische, elektrische en configuratietechnische aspecten. Deze multidisciplinaire werkwijze sluit aan bij hoe Project Engineering binnen Voortman is ingericht.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>Je gaat onder andere:</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><ul><li><p>ondersteunen bij de technische voorbereiding van klantprojecten;</p></li><li><p>layouts en machineconfiguraties controleren en aanpassen;</p></li><li><p>klantspecifieke afwijkingen, opties en interfaces beoordelen;</p></li><li><p>afstemmen met mechanische, elektrische en configuratie-engineering;</p></li><li><p>technische aandachtspunten en wijzigingen vastleggen en opvolgen.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>Naast het meewerken aan projecten pak je een eigen praktijkopdracht op. Je werkt een kleinere technische verbetering of standaardoplossing uit die binnen meerdere klantprojecten kan worden toegepast. Je brengt de eisen in kaart, stemt jouw voorstel af met de betrokken disciplines en toetst de oplossing binnen een actueel project. Zo lever je een toepasbare technische verbetering op én doe je praktijkervaring op met project engineering, machinebouw en multidisciplinaire samenwerking.</p> <br> <h2>Wij vragen</h2><ul><li><p>Je volgt een technische MBO 4- of HBO-opleiding in de richting van Werktuigbouwkunde, Mechatronica of vergelijkbaar;</p></li><li><p>Je hebt interesse in machinebouw, productie en technische processen;</p></li><li><p>Je werkt nauwkeurig, neemt initiatief en stemt gemakkelijk af met collega’s.</p></li></ul><h2>Wij bieden</h2><ul><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst">Een vergoeding: €600,- per maand;</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">Reiskostenvergoeding: zodat jij geen onnodige kosten maakt;</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">Apparatuur en materialen: bijvoorbeeld een laptop, speciaal gereedschap of software;</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">Ervaren coach: goede begeleiding is belangrijk en dus krijg je een vaste coach om je te ondersteunen;</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast">Ruimte voor persoonlijke ontwikkeling.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><figure><img style="width:1920px" alt="Voortman Nederland" src="https://recruitee-main.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/58lgk3d2db/Voortman_Nederland-R.jpg"></figure><h2>Over Voortman</h2><p>Wat in 1968 begon in een kippenschuur in Rijssen, is uitgegroeid tot wereldspeler in CNC-staalbewerkingsmachines. Met een team van meer dan 750 collega’s wereldwijd ontwikkelen en bouwen we niet alleen high-end machines, maar ook slimme software en service waarop klanten kunnen vertrouwen. Deze 3 krachtige bouwstenen maken ons Twentse, internationale familiebedrijf uniek.</p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/compani