gen we dat belangrijke processen in onze samenleving altijd doordraaien.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="text-align:start;"><span style="color:#5a5f72">Zodra je Centric komt versterken, omring jij jezelf met mogelijkheden. Zo kun je jouw kennis vergroten door samen te werken met de ongeveer 300 collega’s van Centric Retail &amp; Logistiek. Als partner van bedrijven binnen Retail, Logistiek, Transport, Bouw en Financiële instellingen zorgen wij er dagelijks voor dat magazijnen goed gevuld blijven, supermarkten en winkels bevoorraad worden en honderdduizenden klanten hun dagelijkse boodschappen en andere aankopen naadloos kunnen afrekenen. Maar ook dat vrachtwagens zo optimaal mogelijk beladen en geoptimaliseerde routes rijden, bouwbedrijven inzicht hebben in hun projectplanning en resources en dat financiële instellingen snel kredietrisico’s kunnen inschatten met onze risk solutions. Kortom, een rol binnen Centric Retail &amp; Logistiek geeft je de mogelijkheid om een concrete bijdrage te leveren aan sectoren die impact hebben en maken op de maatschappij!</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="text-align:start;"><strong><span style="color:#5a5f72">We only have positions available for Dutch-speaking applicants residing in the Netherlands.</span></strong></p><p style="text-align:start;"><span style="color:#5a5f72">&nbsp;</span></p><p style="text-align:start;"><em><span style="color:#5a5f72">Centric aanvaardt geen ongevraagde hulp van intermediairs/uitzendbureaus of andere derden voor onze vacatures. Toegestuurde cv’s (in welke vorm dan ook) door genoemde partijen aan enige medewerkers van Centric zonder geldige schriftelijke zoekopdracht van onze HR Afdeling of Recruiters, worden beschouwd als publieke informatie. Er zal aan genoemde partijen geen vergoeding zijn verschuldigd in geval dat een kandidaat wordt aangenomen van wie ongevraagd het cv en/of andere gegevens zijn toegestuurd.</span></em></p> <br> <p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/centric/senior-business-consultant-hoogeveen-390387","tags":["Consultancy"],"job_types":["Mid","fulltime fixed term"],"location":"Hoogeveen, Drenthe, Nederland","created_at":1794562297},{"slug":"brand-marketing-stagiaire-amsterdam-433436","company_name":"Inner Circle","title":"Brand Marketing Stagiair(e)","description":"<p><strong><span style="color:#000000">Start:</span></strong><span style="color:#000000"> Februari 2027<br></span><strong><span style="color:#000000">Beschikbaarheid:</span></strong><span style="color:#000000"> 32 uur per week<br></span><strong><span style="color:#000000">Periode:</span></strong><span style="color:#000000"> 6 maanden</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><span style="color:#000000">Inner Circle is ontworpen voor mensen die weten wat ze zoeken. Geen eindeloos swipen, maar relevante matches met mensen met dezelfde lifestyle, waar elke dag duizenden dates uit ontstaan.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">Doel van de rol</span></strong></p><p><span style="color:#000000">Als Brand Marketing Stagiair(e) help je mee om Inner Circle zichtbaar, relevant en onderscheidend te maken op de socials. Je werkt nauw samen met het marketing- en content team en krijgt veel ruimte om te creëren, te testen, te analyseren en te leren. Van TikTok-trends tot community-interactie en performance-inzichten: jij helpt ons bouwen aan content dat niet alleen entertaint, maar ook iets in beweging zet.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">Wat je gaat doen: </span></strong></p><ul><li><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">Content Creation:</span></strong><span style="color:#000000"> Je helpt met het creëren en inplannen van content voor Instagram &amp; TikTok. Denk aan Reels, Stories, educatieve posts en leuke trends die mensen laten stoppen met scrollen.</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">Trends spotten:</span></strong><span style="color:#000000"> Je houdt trends in de gaten en vertelt ons what’s hot (and what’s not). Jij weet als eerste wat viraal gaat, en kan het direct vertalen naar Reels/ posts voor Inner Circle. Let’s roll! Het hoeft niet perfect, het gaat vandaag nog live!</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">Campagnes analyseren:</span></strong><span style="color:#000000"> Je analyseert, rapporteert en evalueert social media content en campagnes.</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">UGC Scouting: </span></strong><span style="color:#000000">Je helpt ons de leukste (UGC) creators te vinden die matchen met onze merkwaarden / wie wij zijn.</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">Copy writing:</span></strong><span style="color:#000000"> je vindt het leuk om te schrijven en kan iedereen met jouw woorden overtuigen. Je ondersteunt ons met het schrijven van CRM materiaal: van nieuwsbrieven en blogposts tot pushberichten en in app alerts.</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">Community management:</span></strong><span style="color:#000000"> Daarnaast ga je in gesprek met onze volgers, beantwoord je comments en DM’s en help je mee aan het opbouwen van een levendige en loyale dating community.</span></p></li></ul> <br> <p><strong><span style="color:#000000">Wat wij zoeken:</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Een echte content liefhebber. Of je nu achter de camera staat of verdwaald bent in je FYP, jij weet wat er online speelt!</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Duidelijk, zelfverzekerd en creatief is met woorden, zowel geschreven als gesproken. En zich comfortabel voelt voor én achter de camera.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Ervaring heeft met TikTok, Instagram en tools als Figma, Canva, CapCut etc.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Creatief is, maar ook resultaatgericht, analytisch en gestructureerd werkt.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Beschikbaar is om te starten vanaf eind februari 2027 (flexibele ingangsdatum).</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Een HBO- of WO studie volgt en op zoek is naar een fulltime stage, voor een periode van minimaal 6 maanden.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p></li></ul><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">Over Inner Circle</span></strong></p><p><span style="color:#000000">Inner Circle voelt minder als een datingapp en meer als een members club voor dating.</span></p><p><span style="color:#000000">We zijn gebouwd op de overtuiging dat tegenpolen niet aantrekken. Daarom brengen we mensen samen die bewust kiezen met wie ze daten en elkaar herkennen in levensstijl, ritme en intentie. Dat zorgt voor relevantere matches en dates die sneller kloppen.</span></p><p><span style="color:#000000">Inner Circle is een onafhankelijke, bootstrapped techbedrijf. We werden opgenomen in de FT1000 als een van Europa’s snelst groeiende bedrijven en wonnen de Deloitte Technology Fast 50 in Nederland.</span></p><p><span style="color:#000000">Ons team bestaat uit 40 mensen met 16 nationaliteiten en een 60:40 man-vrouwverhouding. Diversiteit zien we niet als beleid, maar als realiteit. Bij Inner Circle is er ruimte om jezelf te zijn in hoe je werkt en wie je bent.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">Solliciteren?</span></strong></p><p><span style="color:#000000">Geïnteresseerd in deze kans? Solliciteer snel en eenvoudig, beantwoord een paar korte vragen zodat wij je beter kunnen leren kennen.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style="color:#000000">Houd er rekening mee dat we kandidaten al tijdens het proces selecteren, dus wacht niet te lang. We kijken uit naar je sollicitatie!</span></p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/inner-circle/brand-marketing-stagiaire-amsterdam-433436","tags":[],"job_types":["Student school","internship"],"location":"Amsterdam, Noord-Holland, Netherlands","created_at":1794562297},{"slug":"security-engineer-amsterdam-384590","company_name":"bunq","title":"Security Engineer","description":"<p style="text-align:start;">At bunq, we’re on a mission to Make Life Easy for our users by creating the most user-centric banking experience out there. That starts with keeping their data safe. As AI makes attackers faster, we’re seeing more critical zero-day vulnerabilities than ever, and we need to stay ahead of them.</p><p style="text-align:start;">That’s where you come in. As our&nbsp;<strong>Security Engineer</strong>, you’ll own how 700 colleagues get secure access to our systems, and you’ll help defend bunq against attacks as they happen. You’ll design and build security processes that AI can’t run on its own, and automate everything that it can.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="text-align:start;"><strong>Take Ownership 🚀</strong></p><p style="text-align:start;">You’ll keep bunq secure, from access control to incident response. Here’s how you’ll do it:</p><ul><li><p>Own access control governance in Okta Identity Governance, automating how access is granted, revoked and reviewed, so every employee and contractor has the right access from day one. </p></li><li><p>Investigate and triage security incidents and vulnerability findings, decide whether they’re malicious, and escalate or fix them fast. </p></li><li><p>Drive the replacement of our security monitoring system with an AI-based platform that detects and stops threats automatically, and build automations so the team can focus on real security issues.</p></li></ul> <br> <ul><li><p>You’ve worked hands-on as a security engineer, investigating and triaging security incidents.</p></li><li><p>You write code to automate security work, not just to run scripts.</p></li><li><p>You’ve worked with identity governance and know how to build secure login and access solutions.</p></li><li><p>You communicate clearly with stakeholders, especially under pressure when someone is locked out or an incident hits.</p></li><li><p>You bring engineering experience. Consultancy experience alone isn’t the right fit.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="text-align:start;"><em>Curious to see how we make life easy? - try the <a rel="noopener" target="_blank" href="https://app.adjust.com/1tyd4x67?fallback=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bunq.com%2F&redirect_macos=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bunq.com%2F">bunq app</a>, it only takes 5 minutes to sign up.</em></p><p style="text-align:start;min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="text-align:start;"><strong>Your space to perform</strong></p><p style="text-align:start;">We give you the space and the tools you need to succeed 💪</p><p style="text-align:start;">🤟 Great, international colleagues who share your mindset</p><p style="text-align:start;">👩‍💻 Hybrid setup: after 3 months in-office, work 2 days remote, 3 days in-office weekly.</p><p style="text-align:start;">🧳 Digital Nomad Program: After your first year, enjoy up to 20 days per year to work while traveling, combining flexibility with strong team collaboration</p><p style="text-align:start;">🚀 We reward tenure with a dedicated travel budget: €1.5k after 2 years and €3k after 4 years to visit another core office.</p><p style="text-align:start;">📚 We support growth with bunq Academy and €1500 annual learning budget</p><p style="text-align:start;">🧘 €60 monthly allowance via Alleo by Epassi, rolling over monthly and resetting annually</p><p style="text-align:start;">🚌﻿ Travel expenses are covered whether you come walking or by bike, bus or car (though we prefer green choices 🌳)</p><p style="text-align:start;">﻿💻 A MacBook so you can Get Shit Done with us</p><p style="text-align:start;">🥦 Delicious lunches from our fabulous in-house chefs with vegan and vegetarian options</p><p style="text-align:start;">💰 An optional pension plan with monthly contribution from bunq</p><p style="text-align:start;">💸 Monthly contribution to your phone and internet bills</p><p style="text-align:start;">🍻 Friday drinks and other celebrations - bunq style﻿</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="text-align:start;"><em>All new hires are subject to Pre-employment Screening (PES), which includes checks conducted by our third-party partner, Zinc. This is part of our commitment to a secure and trustworthy workplace</em></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/bunq/security-engineer-amsterdam-384590","tags":["Technology"],"job_types":["Experienced","fulltime permanent"],"location":"Amsterdam, Noord-Holland, Netherlands","created_at":1794562296},{"slug":"remote-senior-cloud-engineer-utrecht-183144","company_name":"Luscii","title":"Senior Cloud Engineer","description":"<p>At Luscii, we're creating space for care by developing and improving digital healthcare applications that make a real difference in people's lives through several applications. From Luscii Thuismeten, which helps healthcare professionals monitor patients remotely, to OMRON Connect, connecting millions of people with their health data through OMRON devices, and other applications that expand the possibilities of digital healthcare.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>Together with healthcare professionals and partners around the world, we're working towards a future where people receive the right care in the right place. As our Senior Cloud Engineer, you'll help shape and modernise the cloud infrastructure behind these applications, building a reliable, scalable and future-proof foundation for millions of users worldwide.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>Our applications have different histories, architectures and technical challenges. OMRON Connect, for example, runs on an AWS backend serving several million monthly active users. Parts of its infrastructure still carry legacy, including manual processes, scattered knowledge, inconsistent observability and release processes that make changes slower and riskier than they should be.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>We're working towards a more consistent engineering foundation across our applications. Think Infrastructure as Code, cloud-native and event-driven architecture where it adds value, safe continuous deployment and observability by default. We're bringing more senior engineering expertise in-house to turn that ambition into concrete technical decisions, shared standards and a roadmap our teams can own. And that's where you come in 😉</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h3>Your role</h3><p>You will work across our engineering teams, helping shape the cloud infrastructure behind our digital healthcare applications. Your focus will be on making the right architectural decisions, modernising existing platforms and enabling teams to independently build, maintain and improve their systems.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>This isn't a greenfield architecture exercise. You will be improving live healthcare platforms while balancing technical improvements with product delivery, security, regulatory requirements and the realities of working with stakeholders across different countries, including the Netherlands and Japan.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>What you will be doing, among others:</p><ul><li><p>Own and evolve the Cloud &amp; Backend roadmap, translating the engineering vision into clear priorities, trade-offs and next steps.</p></li><li><p>Drive cross-team architecture decisions to a close, making sure decisions are transparent, documented and followed through.</p></li><li><p>Establish shared technical standards and guardrails that allow teams to work autonomously without creating unnecessary dependencies.</p></li><li><p>Work hands-on with engineers on AWS and Terraform, reviewing designs and pull requests and challenging technical choices where needed.</p></li><li><p>Coach and pair with engineers, helping knowledge spread across teams and supporting the growth of seniority and ownership.</p></li><li><p>Work with product owners, QA, engineering leadership and colleagues in Japan to balance technical direction with product, regulatory, security and cost considerations.</p></li><li><p>Help move the platform towards automated infrastructure, safer deployments and stronger observability without relying on a big-bang rewrite.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>The responsibilities outlined above reflect how we currently envision this role. As we continue to grow and evolve, the scope and focus of the position may naturally change, influenced by your own ideas and insights. The way we work is built around the belief that everyone's input matters. If you see opportunities to improve the way we do things, or believe a process could be designed differently to achieve a better outcome, we encourage you to bring those ideas forward. Discuss them with your teammates, challenge the status quo, and help shape how we move forward together.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h3>Why Luscii?</h3><p><a rel="noopener" target="_blank" href="https://jobs.luscii.com/life-at-luscii/">Read more</a> about working at Luscii / OMRON and <a rel="noopener" target="_blank" href="https://jobs.luscii.com/how-we-work/">how</a> we work as a team. Together, we are working on a mission to create space for care. Freedom, autonomy and ownership are of great importance in this. You are responsible for your own results and work according to the principles of Holacracy. Luscii is part of <strong>OMRON</strong> <strong>DH</strong>; together we built for the long term. To work on making healthcare better.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h3>Most important benefits</h3><ul><li><p><strong>Salary</strong>: An annual maximum remuneration of approximately € 85.000 gross per year is estimated for this position (based on 32 hours per week – that’s full-time at Luscii), depending on the interviews, your experience, background and knowledge.</p></li><li><p><strong>Remote-first</strong>: Work from anywhere in The Netherlands. We stay connected through monthly in-person team days called <em>Assemblii</em>.</p></li><li><p><strong>Flexible setup</strong>: Create your own ideal workspace. Whatever works best for you - we’ve got you covered here. We do work from Mondays to Thursdays, as 32 hours per week is fulltime.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h3>The ideal candidate…</h3><p>… probably doesn't exist, but if you can tick most of the checkboxes below, please apply! We are looking for someone who enjoys taking ownership of complex technical challenges, makes pragmatic engineering decisions, and is excited about helping others succeed along the way.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>You know when to step up, when to involve colleagues and when to move forward decisively. Working independently does not mean working in isolation for you. You feel at ease being both a self-starter and a committed team player, contributing to shared goals while taking responsibility for your own domain. You value open communication, transparency, and mutual trust.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><ul><li><p>You have at least 5+ years of experience in cloud/backend engineering and multiple years of hands-on experience with AWS and Terraform (Infrastructure as Code). </p></li><li><p>You are comfortable reviewing designs and pull requests. Experience with serverless and event-driven architectures is very valuable. All combined with experience in serverless AWS, Node.js/TypeScript tech stacks.</p></li><li><p>You actively coach, pair, review and share knowledge, with a focus on building ownership and seniority across the teams around you.</p></li><li><p>You understand what matters: the importance of making pragmatic technical choices within clear security, compliance and regulatory boundaries.</p></li><li><p>You are open to working in a Holacratic organization and curious about our way of organizing work, roles, and responsibilities;</p></li><li><p>English is our primary language for all internal communication at Luscii, so you're fluent in that language.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h3><strong>Interested? Apply now!</strong></h3><p>Would you like more information? Feel free to contact our recruiter Björn Bogerd via <a rel="noopener" target="_blank" ---------- style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h3><strong>What does the recruitment process look like?</strong></h3><p>We organise three interviews for each vacancy. It is an extensive process, but we want to ensure that there is a good fit in regards to a potential collaboration, our culture and our way of working. All interviews are conducted online and the entire procedure is planned in advance to keep momentum.</p> <br> <p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":true,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/luscii/remote-senior-cloud-engineer-utrecht-183144","tags":["Software Development","Remote"],"job_types":["Mid","fulltime permanent"],"location":"Remote job","created_at":1794562293},{"slug":"meewerk-stage-continuous-improvement-power-bi-power-automate-oirschot-375","company_name":"Heras B.V.","title":"Meewerk Stage Continuous Improvement (Power BI & Power Automate)","description":"<p class="MsoNormal">Ben jij analytisch sterk en wil je impact maken binnen een internationale organisatie? Dan moeten we jou hebben! </p><p><strong>Jouw rol</strong><br>Bij Heras krijg je de kans om als stagiair bij te dragen aan het Nimble-programma: een strategisch verbeterprogramma gericht op het vereenvoudigen en automatiseren van bedrijfsprocessen. Als stagiair werk je aan het verbeteren van processen binnen domeinen zoals sales, projecten in nieuwbouw en finance. Je analyseert hoe processen vandaag werken en vertaalt dit naar slimme oplossingen met behulp van Power BI en Power Automate. Je levert concrete procesverbeteringen, procesbeschrijvingen, automatiseringen en Power BI dashboards voor operationele en financiële sturing aan alsmede werkende Power Automate flows. Tenslotte lever je een meetbare bijdrage aan efficiëntie (bijv. tijdbesparing of minder fouten).</p><p><strong>Jouw werkzaamheden</strong></p><ul><li><p class="MsoListBullet">In kaart brengen van huidige processen en knelpunten.</p></li></ul><ul><li><p class="MsoListBullet">Automatiseren van handmatige processen met Power Automate.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListBullet">Ontwikkelen van dashboards en rapportages in Power BI (zonder daadwerkelijk programmeren).</p></li><li><p class="MsoListBullet">Verbeteren van datakwaliteit en inzicht in KPI’s.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListBullet">Samenwerken met business teams en IT-specialisten.</p></li></ul><p><strong><em>Benieuwd naar de ervaringen van een stagiair bij Heras? </em></strong><em><u><a rel="noopener" target="_blank" href="https://www.heras.nl/stories/blogs/bart-de-ridder">De eerste indruk: dynamisch in plaats van stoffig - Heras Nederland</a></u></em></p><p><strong>Wie zijn wij?</strong><br>Heras is een vooraanstaand Europese totaalleverancier van permanente perimeter protection oplossingen. Wij opereren vanuit meer dan 24 landen en hebben meer dan 1100 hoogopgeleide experts in dienst. Opgericht in 1952, vervult en overtreft Heras de beveiligingsbehoeften van klanten in heel Europa. Het is dankzij deze staat van dienst, samen met het blijvend groeiende vakmanschap van onze medewerkers, dat wij ons experts in perimeter protection kunnen noemen. </p><p><strong>Onze cultuur, werksfeer &amp; waarden</strong><br>Wij hebben binnen Heras een informele, open en toegankelijke cultuur. We zijn trots op ons werk, producten en dienstverlening. We hebben een no-nonsense mentaliteit, tonen ondernemerschap, zijn energiek en werken allemaal gedisciplineerd volgens de drie kernwaarden; betrokkenheid, betrouwbaarheid en deskundigheid. Heras is gewaardeerd op een Ecovadis Zilveren Ster en dat plaatst ons bij de duurzaamste 15% bedrijven van Nederland. Onze doelstelling is streven naar Goud in de komende jaren en volledig CO2 neutraal zijn in 2050. Wil je hier meer over weten?<span style="color:#000000"> </span><a rel="noopener" target="_blank" href="https://www.heras.nl/over-heras/kwaliteit-en-veiligheid/">https://www.heras.nl/over-heras/kwaliteit-en-veiligheid/</a></p> <br> <p><strong>Jouw profiel</strong></p><ul><li><p class="MsoListBullet">Je volgt een HBO- of WO-opleiding (bijv. Bedrijfskunde, Technische Bedrijfskunde, IT, Data of Finance)</p></li><li><p class="MsoListBullet">Je zoekt een 3e of 4e jaars stage waarbij de nadruk ligt op meewerken of bouwen van dashboarding</p></li><li><p class="MsoListBullet">Je hebt interesse in procesverbetering en data</p></li><li><p class="MsoListBullet">Je hebt basiskennis van of affiniteit met Power BI en/of Power Automate</p></li><li><p class="MsoListBullet">Je bent analytisch, proactief en communicatief sterk</p></li><li><p class="MsoListBullet">Onze voorkeur gaat uit naar een kandidaat die de Nederlandse taal goed beheerst</p></li><li><p class="MsoListBullet">Hoewel het niet zelf programmeren beterft vindt je het wel leuk om zelf oplossingen te verzinnen en te testen</p></li></ul><p><strong>Wat bieden wij jou?</strong><br>Bij Heras bieden wij jou een meewerkstage binnen een zeer dynamische omgeving waarbij elke dag anders is met veel variatie en afwisseling. Je draagt je steentje bij aan een veilige omgeving en helpt om onze samenleving te beschermen. Tenslotte zijn er volop mogelijkheden om jezelf te ontwikkelen en door te groeien. Wij bieden het volgende:</p><ul><li><p>Stagevergoeding van €500,- bruto o.b.v. fulltime</p></li><li><p>2 verlofdagen per maand</p></li><li><p>Flexibiliteit en vrijheid</p></li><li><p>Reiskostenvergoeding van 0,23ct per kilometer tussen 5- en 60km enkele reis</p></li><li><p>Laptop voor gebruik bij Heras</p></li></ul><p><strong>Iets voor jou?</strong><br>Als je graag meer informatie wil ontvangen over de vacature of sollicitatieprocedure neem dan contact op met onze Corporate Recruiter Bram Smits via 0629148655.</p><p><em>Voor externe partijen: Acquisitie naar aanleiding van deze vacature wordt niet op prijs gesteld. Heras behoudt hiermee het recht om ingestuurde kandidaten rechtstreeks te benaderen.</em></p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/heras-bv/meewerk-stage-continuous-improvement-power-bi-power-automate-oirschot-375","tags":["Stage"],"job_types":["Experienced","fulltime permanent"],"location":"Oirschot, Noord-Brabant, Nederland","created_at":1794562293},{"slug":"remote-account-executive-dutch-speaker-netherlands-83879","company_name":"Huzzle","title":"Account Executive - Dutch Speaker","description":"<h3>About Huzzle</h3><p>At Huzzle, we connect high-performing professionals with global companies across the UK, US, Canada, Europe, and Australia. Our clients include startups, digital agencies, and tech platforms in industries like SaaS, MarTech, FinTech, and EdTech. We match top sales talent to full-time remote roles where they’re hired directly into client teams and provided ongoing support by Huzzle.</p><p></p><p><strong>Role Type: Full-time</strong></p><p><strong>Engagement: Independent Contractor </strong></p><p></p><h3>About the Company</h3><p>Our client operates in the real estate and home improvement industry, specialising in bathroom remodelling. They help homeowners transform their bathrooms through tailored renovation solutions. They are looking for an experienced Dutch-speaking High-Ticket Sales Closer to join their sales team and convert qualified prospects into customers.</p><p>Working directly with prospective customers through video sales calls, you'll be responsible for building rapport, understanding customer needs, handling objections, and closing high-value deals. This is an opportunity for a confident sales professional who knows how to create trust, communicate value, and consistently deliver results in a performance-driven environment.</p><p></p><h3>Key Responsibilities</h3><ul><li>Conduct approximately 4–5 video sales calls per day with qualified prospects who have booked and attended their appointments</li><li>Handle a target of approximately 45 qualified showed sales calls per month</li><li>Convert qualified prospects into customers, targeting an average of 1–2 direct sales per day</li><li>Build strong relationships with prospective customers through excellent communication, active listening, and rapport-building techniques</li><li>Use mirroring techniques and an adaptable tone of voice to establish trust and connect with different customer personalities</li><li>Understand customer requirements, present suitable solutions, and communicate the value of bathroom remodelling services</li><li>Handle objections confidently and guide prospects through the decision-making process</li><li>Apply culturally sensitive communication and closing techniques when engaging with Dutch-speaking customers</li><li>Maintain accurate sales activity and follow-ups using the company's systems</li><li>Work towards revenue generation targets, with a reference target of 400K</li></ul><p><strong>Requirements</strong></p><ul><li>Fluent in both Dutch and English (essential)</li><li>Proven experience in sales, particularly cold calling and direct sales</li><li>Demonstrable high-ticket sales and closing experience</li><li>Strong objection-handling and negotiation skills</li><li>Excellent verbal communication skills and a confident, engaging tone of voice</li><li>Strong rapport-building, active listening, and mirroring skills</li><li>Ability to adapt communication and closing techniques to different customer personalities and cultural backgrounds</li><li>Comfortable conducting video sales calls and working towards daily sales and revenue targets</li><li>Reliable, organised, and able to communicate availability consistently</li><li>Familiarity with GoHighLevel, Slack, and Google Meet</li></ul><p></p><h3><strong>Nice to Have</strong></h3><ul><li>Previous experience in real estate or property-related sales</li><li>Experience in construction, home improvement, or bathroom remodelling</li><li>Experience selling high-value renovation or home improvement services</li></ul><p><strong>Benefits</strong></p><p>💻 Fully Remote: Work from anywhere with international teams</p><p>🚀 Career Growth: Join companies in SaaS, MarTech, and B2B services</p><p>🤝 Peer Community: Connect with high-performing sales professionals in our network</p><p>🧭 Ongoing Support: Receive guidance from Huzzle before and after placement</p><p>💰 Tailored Compensation: Salaries vary by client and candidate preference — we’ll match you with options that fit your goals</p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":true,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/huzzle/remote-account-executive-dutch-speaker-netherlands-83879","tags":["Sales","Internet","Remote"],"job_types":["Full time","mid-senior"],"location":"Netherlands","created_at":1794554415},{"slug":"senior-backend-engineer-buyer-252245","company_name":"Vinteden","title":"Senior Backend Engineer, Buyer","description":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brief info about Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our mission is to make second-hand the first choice, and we&#39;re looking for people who want to help us get there. Every day, we work together to help our members buy and sell pre-loved clothing and lifestyle items, giving each piece a second life – or even a third. &lt;br&gt;The Vinted Group is made up of three business units that support this mission:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/marketplace&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Vinted Marketplace&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; is Europe’s leading platform for second-hand fashion and a go-to destination for all kinds of pre-loved items, with a growing range of categories. Our platform connects millions of members across 20+ markets, helping great items find a new life.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedgo&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Go&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; enhances the shipping experience with a vast network of over 500,000 pick-up and drop-off points, partnering with more than 60 carriers across Europe, with added services like item verification for peace of mind on high-value pieces.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedpay&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Pay&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is the newest part of the Vinted Group, dedicated to bringing secure, reliable payments to buyers and sellers across Europe. Seamlessly integrated into the Vinted app, it helps keep every transaction safe, efficient, and easy for our members.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Founded in 2008 in Lithuania, Vinted began as a way for friends to find new homes for clothes they no longer needed. In 2019, we became Lithuania&#39;s first unicorn! Today, our headquarters remain in Vilnius, and we&#39;ve grown with offices across Europe, supported by a team of over 2,000 people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Information about the position&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Buyer Domain at Vinted is dedicated to creating a seamless and highly engaging experience for our members as they search, discover, and purchase items. Our challenge is unique: unlike standard e-commerce, our peer-to-peer catalogue consists of hundreds of millions of entirely unique, single-inventory listings, with millions of new items uploaded daily. Connecting the right buyer with the perfect item in real-time is at the very core of Vinted&#39;s success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The CVP team owns the core platform and services that govern how content is geofenced, balanced, and surfaced across Vinted&#39;s growing international network of markets. We build robust systems and tooling that manage cross-border visibility, enabling smooth and gradual market connections (e.g., FR-DE, BE-FR-ES) while optimising key liquidity metrics like Sell-Through Rate (STR%) and Gross Merchandise Value (GMV) by balancing the content in multiple channels.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our team works closely with Content Visibility Management, Search, and Recommender relevance teams to accelerate product development. Currently, we are driving the automation of content visibility experimentation &amp;amp; analysis. Rather than having different content channels independently re-implement visibility controls, we are building a unified platform to provide autonomy to Decision Scientists. In addition, we are highly contributing in growing new large markets such as the USA and Australia.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this position, you’ll&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive technical execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Design, implement, and maintain highly scalable, reliable, and secure backend systems to ensure efficient content visibility and search mechanisms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Guide technical decisions:&lt;/strong&gt; Contribute to and challenge the technical direction of our backend services, leading system design reviews and ensuring high-quality, maintainable code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale features globally:&lt;/strong&gt; Implement and shape A/B tested features that positively impact our 80+ million users. Code changes are rolled out instantly to production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own your services:&lt;/strong&gt; Monitor and improve backend service performance and stability. The team owns and monitors service-layer measurements (SLIs, SLOs, etc.) and has an on-call rotation which you will participate in.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead team-level initiatives:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead and drive technical initiatives within the team, while collaborating on domain-wide integrations with other engineering teams (such as Search and Recommender relevance teams).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate cross-functionally:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with engineering and product managers, analysts, and other stakeholders, facilitating clear communication within the team and across domains.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contribute to product direction:&lt;/strong&gt; Provide technical feasibility assessments, identify technical risks, and provide effort estimations to help shape our team&#39;s product roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Foster engineering excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; Mentor, guide, and share knowledge with other engineers in the team to support their technical growth and promote collaborative best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have extensive experience in backend software engineering, with a proven track record of designing and building scalable, distributed, and highly available systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are highly proficient in backend development. We primarily use Go, Kotlin, Ruby, Python — while prior experience in these specific languages is beneficial, a strong foundation in modern backend engineering and a willingness to learn is what matters most.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with event streaming platforms like Kafka, Apache Flink, or others for real-time data processing and message queueing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record working with search engines, information retrieval and ranking optimisations technologies (e.g., Vespa, Elasticsearch, OpenSearch) is a high advantage. If not, we expect you to have a strong willingness and motivation to learn.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are enthusiastic about AI technologies, use AI tools daily in your work, and proactively learn and experiment with how to adopt AI to boost engineering outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of continuous integration and deployment pipelines, with experience in tools like Jenkins for automating builds and deployments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with observability and monitoring tools (we use Grafana, Kibana, and others) to keep services healthy and define SLIs/SLOs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with relational and in-memory databases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong collaboration and communication skills, with experience working with cross-functional peers (Product, Analytics, SRE).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in mentoring other engineers, providing constructive feedback, and promoting engineering best practices within your team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and spoken English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;JobsDescription_sectionTitle__ZlnGI&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work perks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;JobsDescription_sectionContent__jYQtX&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to benefit from our share options programme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days of paid annual leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Newest MacBook models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidential Employee Assistance Program (EAP) for you and your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frequent team-building events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home office support: we provide IT workstation equipment and a personal budget of up to €540 for home workplace furniture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A daily lunch allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company bike leasing scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly budget for a flexible benefits platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work from Home allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collective Defined Contribution Pension plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A personal monthly budget for shopping on Vinted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An NS mobility card&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dog-friendly office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;JobsDescription_sectionTitle__ZlnGI&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working at Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;JobsDescription_sectionContent__jYQtX&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workation policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;JobsDescription_sectionContent__jYQtX&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Better balance holidays with workdays by working remotely! Up to 90 days per year in the EU, of these, 21 days can be spent globally. For non-EU citizens, it&#39;s 21 days worldwide. This can be combined with time off for vacation or personal time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;JobsDescription_sectionContent__jYQtX&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Individual learning budget&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;JobsDescription_sectionContent__jYQtX&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Each year, you’ll be given a learning budget (starting at €3,000), and a total of up to 10 working days over a 2-year period to support your personal and professional development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;JobsDescription_sectionContent__jYQtX&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;JobsDescription_sectionContent__jYQtX&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our hybrid model, with 2 recommended office days a week, gives you and your team the flexibility to decide if and when you want to work from home, and when to catch up in person.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;JobsDescription_sectionContent__jYQtX&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;JobsDescription_sectionContent__jYQtX&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome applications from everybody, regardless of your background, identity, or life experiences. Job openings come with guides, not checklists. If you’re excited about a role, but don’t identify with every point in the ‘About you’ section, apply anyway – you might still be the perfect match!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The annual gross salary range for this position excluding 8% holiday pay is:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€76.800&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€104.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/vinteden/senior-backend-engineer-buyer-252245","tags":["Engineering"],"job_types":[],"location":"","created_at":1794552918},{"slug":"junior-logistics-executive-netherlands-amsterdam-479080","company_name":"Nivoda","title":"Junior Logistics Executive (Netherlands)","description":"<p style="min-height:1.5em"><em><strong>Important Information</strong></em></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em>This role is a full time, permanent, in office position.</em></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em>Working hours: M-F, 10AM - 6:30PM </em></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em>Location: Oude Meer, North Holland, 1438 BC</em></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em>Contract: 6 month FTC </em></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h1><strong>About Nivoda</strong></h1><p style="min-height:1.5em">Nivoda is the leading global B2B jewellery marketplace, Nivoda’s growth trajectory has skyrocketed over the past 12 months, and we continue to expand across new regions at an unprecedented pace. Our DNA centers on understanding our customers' needs and offering them a seamless experience. With a growing team based in major cities worldwide, including London, New York, Hong Kong, and Mumbai, Nivoda is becoming the go-to marketplace for the global jewelry industry.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We aim to be bold, innovative, and relentless in our pursuit of excellence as we transform an industry steeped in tradition.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h1><strong>The Role </strong></h1><p style="min-height:1.5em">As a Junior Logistics Executive, you'll be a key player in a tight-knit team. Working alongside highly experienced  logistics professionals at one of our largest international hubs, you'll handle and repack incoming and outgoing diamond shipments with precision and care.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">This is a hands-on, detail-oriented role that sits at the heart of our operations. You’ll be responsible for maintaining the smooth day-to-day flow of the office while upholding our high standards of accuracy and security. With our rapidly growing company, the opportunities for personal and professional growth are enormous.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">If you're looking for a fast-paced, highly supportive environment where your attention to detail and reliability will truly shine—this is your moment.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h1><strong>What you'll do:</strong></h1><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Shipment Handling &amp; Repacking:</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Accurately handle, inspect, and repack incoming and outgoing diamond shipments in accordance with company protocols and international shipping standards.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Operational Support:</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Work closely with your two team members to manage the daily operations of the office, ensuring all logistics processes run smoothly and efficiently</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Precision &amp; Security:</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Maintain the highest level of precision, confidentiality, and security when dealing with high-value goods—attention to detail is non-negotiable in this role.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Team Collaboration:</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Collaborate with senior team members to align on priorities, share insights, and uphold our collective standards of excellence.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Process Improvement:</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Contribute ideas to improve workflows and increase operational efficiency as the company continues to scale rapidly.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Growth Mindset:</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Be proactive, reliable, and open to learning. This role offers strong internal growth potential for individuals who show initiative and dedication.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What you'll need for this entry-level role:</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong Attention to Detail</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Ability to repack/handle goods</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Team-Oriented Mindset</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Basic Administrative Skills</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Trustworthiness &amp; Discretion</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Highly desirable </strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience working in high-security logistics environments, preferably with luxury goods, jewelry, or diamonds.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Familiarity with international shipping regulations and customs procedures.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Proficiency in basic logistics software or ERP systems (e.g. SAP, NetSuite, or similar).</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong written and verbal communication skills in English; additional languages are a plus.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Physically fit and able to handle small manual tasks as part of the shipment handling process.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A proactive, solution-oriented attitude with a willingness to grow within a fast-scaling organization.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p></li></ul><h1><strong>What you'll get:</strong></h1><p style="min-height:1.5em">💸Competitive compensation</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">🍎Free lunch</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">🧠 Plenty of opportunities for growth and learning</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">🚀 Chance to join and contribute to a company during its exponential expansion phase</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em">Nivoda is proud to be an equal opportunity workplace dedicated to promoting diversity. We don’t discriminate on the basis of race, religion, colour, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, marital status or disability status.<br />Even if it seems you don't meet 100% of our musts don't let it stop you, we are all about finding the best talent out there! Skills can be learned, and embracing diversity is invaluable.<br /><br />Please note: Our Talent Acquisition Team is international coming from across the world. We kindly ask you to please submit your CV and application in English so that it can be reviewed correctly.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">This is a full time position that's 100% on-site in Oude Meer. Unfortunately, we are unable to offer sponsorship at this time.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><br /><em>*If after reading this job description you believe this is not the best fit for you, we’d encourage you to join our Talent Pool so we can keep you in mind as new roles open up.<br />You can sign up here:</em><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://nivoda.com/careers?ashby_jid=384ab7fa-bcf9-45ab-8665-f5ee26476804"><em> <u>Nivoda Talent Pool</u></em></a></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em>This ensures you're among the first to hear about openings aligned with your skills and interests.</em></p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitno